'=>'速度（每秒像素）','Visitors can close the bar'=>'访客可以关闭此栏','Keep it closed for (days)'=>'保持关闭（天）','0 = until the browser tab is closed. Changing the messages shows the bar again.'=>'0 = 直到关闭浏览器标签页。更改消息后会再次显示此栏。','Counts down to'=>'倒计时至','End'=>'结束','A date and time'=>'日期和时间','A time every day'=>'每天的某个时间','Ends at'=>'结束于','In the time zone of the site (Settings > General). Every visitor sees the same end.'=>'使用网站的时区（设置 > 常规）。每位访客看到的结束时间相同。','Every day at'=>'每天于','For example the cut-off time for same-day shipping. In the time zone of the site.'=>'例如当日发货的截止时间。使用网站的时区。','On these days'=>'在这些日子','After the time and on other days'=>'该时间之后及其他日子','Count down to the next chosen day'=>'倒计时到下一个所选日子','Hide until the next chosen day'=>'隐藏到下一个所选日子','When it ends'=>'结束时','Hide the block'=>'隐藏区块','Show a text'=>'显示文本','Text when it ends'=>'结束时的文本','This offer has ended.'=>'此优惠已结束。','Text above (optional)'=>'上方文本（可选）','Sale ends in'=>'促销结束倒计时','Numbers in boxes'=>'方框中的数字','Plain numbers'=>'纯数字','Show days'=>'显示天数','Off: the hours go above 24.'=>'关闭：小时数会超过 24。','Show seconds'=>'显示秒数','Show labels'=>'显示标签','Numbers'=>'数字','Boxes'=>'方框','Labels'=>'标签','Week'=>'周','For example 9:00-17:00, or 9:00-12:00, 13:00-18:00 with a lunch break. Leave empty for closed. A time after midnight (18:00-2:00) belongs to the day it starts.'=>'例如 9:00-17:00，或含午休的 9:00-12:00, 13:00-18:00。留空表示休息。跨午夜的时间（18:00-2:00）属于开始的那一天。','Closed'=>'休息','Special days'=>'特殊日子','Holidays and other days'=>'节假日和其他日子','One per line: 2026-12-24 = 9:00-12:00 | Christmas Eve, or 12-25 = (closed every year). The note after | is optional.'=>'每行一个：2026-12-24 = 9:00-12:00 | 平安夜，或 12-25 =（每年休息）。| 后面的备注为可选。','List the special days of the next 30 days'=>'列出未来 30 天内的特殊日子','Opening hours'=>'营业时间','Show "Open now / Closed"'=>'显示“营业中 / 已打烊”','Worked out in the visitor\'s browser in the time zone of the site, so it is right on cached pages too.'=>'在访客浏览器中按网站时区计算，因此在缓存页面上也是正确的。','Show the week'=>'显示一周','Highlight today'=>'突出显示今天','Join days with the same hours'=>'合并营业时间相同的日子','Monday – Friday instead of five rows.'=>'显示“周一 – 周五”，而不是五行。','Text for closed days'=>'休息日的文本','Box with a border'=>'带边框的框','Open'=>'营业中','Today'=>'今天','Stock'=>'库存','Stock of'=>'库存对象','Only the real stock is shown: the product (or variation) needs "Manage stock?" turned on in WooCommerce.'=>'仅显示真实库存：产品（或变体）需要在 WooCommerce 中开启“管理库存？”。','Show "Only … left" at this stock or less'=>'库存不高于此数时显示“仅剩 …”','The bar is full at'=>'库存达到此数时条形为满','Stock at or above this number fills the bar.'=>'库存达到或高于此数时条形填满。','Show "In stock" above that number'=>'高于该数时显示“有货”','Show "Out of stock" and backorders'=>'显示“缺货”和预订','Leave empty for the default text. {stock} is the number in stock.'=>'留空则使用默认文本。{stock} 为库存数量。','Low stock'=>'库存不足','Only {stock} left in stock'=>'仅剩 {stock} 件','In stock'=>'有货','Out of stock'=>'缺货','On backorder'=>'可预订','Available on backorder'=>'可预订','Show the bar'=>'显示条形','Show the colored dot'=>'显示彩色圆点','Bar'=>'条形','Bar background'=>'条形背景','Lowest price'=>'最低价格','Price of'=>'价格：','The lowest price comes from the price history that Envo Blocks keeps for every product. Defaults: Envo Blocks > Lowest Price.'=>'最低价格来自 Envo Blocks 为每个产品保存的价格历史。默认值：Envo Blocks > 最低价格。','Number of days (0 = the setting)'=>'天数（0 = 使用设置）','The EU rule is 30 days.'=>'欧盟规定为 30 天。','Show it'=>'显示','As in the setting'=>'与设置相同','Only for products on sale'=>'仅限促销产品','For every product'=>'所有产品','{days} is the number of days, {price} the lowest price. Leave empty for the text of the setting.'=>'{days} 为天数，{price} 为最低价格。留空则使用设置中的文本。','Lowest price in the last {days} days: {price}'=>'最近 {days} 天最低价格：{price}','With a background'=>'带背景','Attribute (color, size …)'=>'属性（颜色、尺码 …）','Category'=>'分类','Stock status'=>'库存状态','On sale'=>'促销','Brand'=>'品牌','Check boxes'=>'复选框','Links'=>'链接','Buttons'=>'按钮','Dropdown'=>'下拉列表','Swatches (colors, images)'=>'色板（颜色、图片）','Filter'=>'筛选','Filters the products of the shop, the categories and the product search (classic shop or the Product Collection block). On other pages the options link to the shop.'=>'筛选商店、分类和产品搜索中的产品（经典商店或 Product Collection 区块）。在其他页面上，选项会链接到商店。','Filter by'=>'筛选依据','Attribute'=>'属性','The first attribute'=>'第一个属性','More values'=>'多个值','Products with any of them'=>'包含任一项的产品','Products with all of them'=>'包含全部的产品','Levels of subcategories'=>'子分类层级','On a category page the filter lists its subcategories.'=>'在分类页面上，筛选器会列出其子分类。','Step of the slider'=>'滑块步长','Leave empty for the name of the filter.'=>'留空则使用筛选器名称。','Hide the title'=>'隐藏标题','Collapsible'=>'可折叠','Yes, open'=>'是，展开','Yes, closed'=>'是，收起','Show the number of products'=>'显示产品数量','Options before "Show more" (0 = all)'=>'“显示更多”之前的选项数（0 = 全部）','Hide options without products'=>'隐藏没有产品的选项','Otherwise they are greyed out. Options that no product of the page has are never shown.'=>'否则以灰色显示。页面中没有任何产品具备的选项永远不会显示。','Envo Blocks PRO filters without reloading the page and adds brands, "On sale", swatches, buttons, dropdowns and a filter drawer for phones.'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 无需重新加载页面即可筛选，并添加品牌、“促销中”、色板、按钮、下拉列表以及手机端筛选抽屉。','Active filters'=>'已选筛选','Shown only while a filter is on. The preview shows a sample.'=>'仅在启用筛选时显示。预览中显示示例。','Show "Clear all"'=>'显示“全部清除”','Track your order'=>'追踪您的订单','Enter your order number and the email address you used at checkout. The order number is in the confirmation email.'=>'请输入您的订单号和结账时使用的电子邮件地址。订单号在确认邮件中。','The form is the WooCommerce order tracking: after a search the order and its updates appear in the same place.'=>'该表单是 WooCommerce 的订单追踪：搜索后，订单及其更新会显示在同一位置。','Free shipping'=>'免运费','Amount for free shipping'=>'免运费金额','From WooCommerce "Free shipping" methods'=>'来自 WooCommerce 的“免运费”方式','Set here'=>'在此设置','Automatic uses the lowest minimum order amount of the Free shipping methods in your shipping zones.'=>'自动使用您配送区域中“免运费”方式的最低订单金额。','Amount (in the shop currency)'=>'金额（商店货币）','Hide when free shipping is reached'=>'达到免运费后隐藏','Use {remaining} for the missing amount and {threshold} for the free shipping amount. Leave empty for the default text.'=>'使用 {remaining} 表示差额，使用 {threshold} 表示免运费金额。留空则使用默认文本。','While the amount is not reached'=>'未达到金额时','Add {remaining} more to get free shipping!'=>'再买 {remaining} 即可享受免运费！','When it is reached'=>'达到金额时','You have free shipping!'=>'您已享受免运费！','When the cart is empty'=>'购物车为空时','Free shipping on orders over {threshold}.'=>'订单满 {threshold} 免运费。','Text alignment'=>'文本对齐','Show progress bar'=>'显示进度条','Bar when reached'=>'达到时的条形','Round heart'=>'圆形爱心','Bookmark'=>'书签','The wishlist page could not be created.'=>'无法创建心愿单页面。','Wishlist page:'=>'心愿单页面：','Edit'=>'编辑','No wishlist page is set yet: this page becomes the wishlist page when it is published.'=>'尚未设置心愿单页面：此页面发布后将成为心愿单页面。','You have no wishlist page yet. The "View" link after saving a product leads there.'=>'您还没有心愿单页面。保存产品后的“查看”链接会指向那里。','Create the wishlist page'=>'创建心愿单页面','Set it in WooCommerce > Settings > Advanced'=>'在 WooCommerce > 设置 > 高级 中设置','Wishlist button'=>'心愿单按钮','On the product page and in a product template (Product Collection) the button uses that product. Choose a product only to place the button somewhere else.'=>'在产品页面和产品模板（Product Collection）中，按钮使用该产品。仅在要将按钮放在其他位置时才选择产品。','Button with an icon and text'=>'带图标和文字的按钮','Round icon'=>'圆形图标','Icon and text (link style)'=>'图标和文字（链接样式）','Add to wishlist'=>'加入心愿单','Text when saved'=>'保存后的文本','In your wishlist'=>'已在心愿单中','Icon and text'=>'图标和文本','Icon when saved'=>'保存后的图标','Wishlist'=>'心愿单','The preview shows a few products of the shop; visitors see their own saved products.'=>'预览显示商店的几件产品；访客看到的是自己保存的产品。','Grid of cards'=>'卡片网格','List (rows)'=>'列表（行）','Up to 3 on tablets, 2 on phones.'=>'平板最多 3 个，手机最多 2 个。','Products with options get a link to the product page.'=>'带选项的产品会显示指向产品页面的链接。','Remove from the wishlist after adding to the cart'=>'加入购物车后从心愿单中移除','A share link, "Add all to cart", hearts on product images and a header icon with a drawer are in Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'分享链接、“全部加入购物车”、产品图片上的爱心以及带抽屉的页眉图标位于 Envo Blocks PRO 中。','Empty wishlist'=>'空心愿单','Your wishlist is empty'=>'您的心愿单是空的','Tap the heart on any product to save it for later.'=>'点击任意产品上的爱心即可保存以备后用。','The button leads to the shop.'=>'按钮指向商店。','Continue shopping'=>'继续购物','As in Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code'=>'与 Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code 中相同','Payment'=>'支付','QR code format'=>'二维码格式','Automatic: QR Platba for CZK, EPC QR for EUR'=>'自动：CZK 使用 QR Platba，EUR 使用 EPC QR','Only QR Platba (CZK)'=>'仅 QR Platba（CZK）','Only EPC QR (EUR)'=>'仅 EPC QR（EUR）','Orders in other currencies get no code.'=>'其他货币的订单不生成二维码。','Account'=>'账户','The accounts with an IBAN from WooCommerce > Settings > Payments > Direct bank transfer.'=>'来自 WooCommerce > 设置 > 支付 > 直接银行转账 中带 IBAN 的账户。','Payment message'=>'付款附言','Placeholders: {order_number}, {order_id}, {site_title}. Empty = as in Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code.'=>'占位符：{order_number}、{order_id}、{site_title}。留空 = 与 Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code 中相同。','Put the block in the Order Confirmation template. It shows only for orders paid by direct bank transfer that wait for the payment.'=>'将此区块放入订单确认模板中。仅对通过直接银行转账支付且等待付款的订单显示。','Pay by QR code'=>'扫码支付','Scan the code with the app of your bank: the account, amount and reference are filled in.'=>'用您银行的应用扫描此码：账户、金额和参考号会自动填写。','Payment details'=>'付款详情','Account, amount, variable symbol and message for entering the payment by hand.'=>'用于手动填写付款的账户、金额、可变符号和附言。','Code beside the details'=>'二维码在详情旁边','Code above the details'=>'二维码在详情上方','QR code size (px)'=>'二维码大小（px）','Empty = the document name and number, e.g. "Invoice 202600012 (PDF)".'=>'留空 = 文档名称和编号，例如“发票 202600012（PDF）”。','Credit notes too'=>'也包括贷项通知单','Put the block in the Order Confirmation template. It shows when the invoice of the order is issued (Envo Blocks > Invoices).'=>'将此区块放入订单确认模板中。当订单的发票开具后显示（Envo Blocks > 发票）。','Additional information'=>'附加信息','Reviews ({count})'=>'评价（{count}）','Own content (blocks)'=>'自定义内容（区块）','The product\'s own tabs'=>'产品自身的选项卡','Tabs of other plugins'=>'其他插件的选项卡','Content of the tab: text, images, a table, any blocks…'=>'选项卡的内容：文本、图片、表格、任意区块…','Tab'=>'选项卡','New tab'=>'新选项卡','Tabs'=>'选项卡','Every tab is a Product Tab block: click a tab to edit it, move it with the arrows of its toolbar or in the List View, add one with the + button. Tabs without content for a product (no description, no attributes, reviews off) are left out.'=>'每个选项卡都是一个 Product Tab 区块：点击选项卡进行编辑，使用其工具栏中的箭头或在列表视图中移动它，用 + 按钮添加新选项卡。对某个产品没有内容的选项卡（没有描述、没有属性、评价已关闭）会被省略。','Tabs of'=>'选项卡对象','Headings inside the panels'=>'面板内的标题','The "Description" and "Additional information" headings WooCommerce prints above the text.'=>'WooCommerce 在文本上方显示的“描述”和“附加信息”标题。','Show as'=>'显示为','Accordion'=>'手风琴','Tabs position'=>'选项卡位置','Boxed'=>'带框','Pills'=>'胶囊','Text only'=>'仅文本','Tabs alignment'=>'选项卡对齐','Full width'=>'全宽','Width of the tabs column (px)'=>'选项卡列的宽度（px）','Accordion on phones'=>'手机上使用手风琴','Below 782 px the tabs turn into an accordion.'=>'低于 782 px 时选项卡变为手风琴。','First item open'=>'默认展开第一项','More items open at once'=>'可同时展开多项','The editor shows the items as tabs; the page shows the accordion.'=>'编辑器以选项卡显示各项；页面上显示为手风琴。','Space around the content (px)'=>'内容周围的间距（px）','Tab text'=>'选项卡文本','Active tab text'=>'活动选项卡的文本','Accent (line, active pill)'=>'强调色（线条、活动胶囊）','Tab background'=>'选项卡背景','Active tab background'=>'活动选项卡的背景','Lines and borders'=>'线条和边框','Content background'=>'内容背景','Content text'=>'内容文本','Adds its tabs only when the product has them.'=>'仅在产品有这些选项卡时才添加。','Add tab'=>'添加选项卡','Dimensions'=>'尺寸','Color'=>'颜色','Black, White'=>'黑色、白色','The reviews of the product and the form for a new review.'=>'产品的评价以及发表新评价的表单。','The tabs of the product (Products > Edit > Product data > Tabs), each as its own tab, here in the order. Nothing when the product has none.'=>'产品的选项卡（产品 > 编辑 > 产品数据 > 选项卡），每个作为单独的选项卡，按此处顺序显示。产品没有时不显示。','Tabs that other plugins add to WooCommerce products (e.g. vendor info, FAQ, size charts), each as its own tab. Nothing when there are none.'=>'其他插件添加到 WooCommerce 产品的选项卡（例如卖家信息、常见问题、尺码表），每个作为单独的选项卡。没有时不显示。','The description of the product (its main text) is shown here.'=>'此处显示产品的描述（其主要文本）。','filled on the product page'=>'在产品页面上填充','{count} is the number of reviews.'=>'{count} 为评价数量。','e.g. Shipping & returns'=>'例如 配送与退货','Only for products in these categories'=>'仅限这些分类中的产品','Empty = every product.'=>'留空 = 所有产品。','How long does delivery take?'=>'配送需要多长时间？','Orders placed by 2 pm on a working day leave the same day. Delivery usually takes 1–3 working days.'=>'工作日 14:00 前下单当天发货。配送通常需要 1–3 个工作日。','Can I return a product?'=>'可以退货吗？','Yes, within 30 days of delivery. Unused products in their original packaging get a full refund.'=>'可以，收货后 30 天内均可退货。未使用且包装完好的商品全额退款。','Which payment methods do you accept?'=>'支持哪些付款方式？','Cards, Apple Pay and Google Pay, bank transfer and cash on delivery.'=>'银行卡、Apple Pay 和 Google Pay、银行转账以及货到付款。','The answer: text, a list, an image, a button…'=>'回答：文字、列表、图片、按钮…','Questions'=>'问题','Every question is a FAQ Item block: type the question, the answer below it is made of blocks. Add a question with the + button, move it with the arrows of its toolbar. The editor shows all answers; the page shows them when a question is clicked.'=>'每个问题都是一个“FAQ 条目”区块：输入问题，下方的回答由区块组成。用 + 按钮添加问题，用其工具栏中的箭头移动。编辑器显示所有回答；页面在点击问题时显示。','First question open'=>'第一个问题展开','More questions open at once'=>'可同时展开多个问题','Off: opening a question closes the open one.'=>'关闭：展开一个问题会收起已展开的问题。','Question as'=>'问题标题级别','Heading 2'=>'标题 2','Heading 3'=>'标题 3','Heading 4'=>'标题 4','For the outline of the page; the look stays the same.'=>'用于页面大纲；外观保持不变。','FAQ data for search engines'=>'搜索引擎 FAQ 数据','Adds schema.org FAQPage data (JSON-LD) with the questions and answers to the page. Turn it off when an SEO plugin already adds FAQ data for this page.'=>'向页面添加含问题和回答的 schema.org FAQPage 数据（JSON-LD）。如果 SEO 插件已为此页面添加 FAQ 数据，请关闭。','Cards'=>'卡片','One box'=>'单个方框','Lines'=>'线条','Plus / minus'=>'加号 / 减号','Arrow'=>'箭头','Space between questions (px)'=>'问题间距（px）','Inner space (px)'=>'内边距（px）','Question text'=>'问题文字','Background of the open question'=>'展开问题的背景','Answer text'=>'回答文字','FAQ Item'=>'FAQ 条目','Question'=>'问题','Open when the page loads'=>'页面加载时展开','Question…'=>'问题…','Customers ask on the product page; you answer in Envo Blocks › Settings › Product Questions. Only answered questions are shown.'=>'顾客在商品页面提问；您在“Envo Blocks › 设置 › 商品问答”中回答。只显示已回答的问题。','Questions of'=>'问题来源','Questions & answers'=>'问答','Questions before "Show more"'=>'“显示更多”前的问题数','Search field'=>'搜索框','From 4 answered questions.'=>'已回答问题达到 4 个时显示。','"Ask a question" form'=>'“提问”表单','Accent (Q / A, buttons)'=>'强调色（Q / A、按钮）','Loading…'=>'正在加载…','Other form (shortcode)'=>'其他表单（短代码）','No supported form plugin is active. Install Contact Form 7, WPForms, Fluent Forms, Ninja Forms, Formidable Forms, Forminator or Gravity Forms, or paste the shortcode of another form.'=>'没有启用受支持的表单插件。请安装 Contact Form 7、WPForms、Fluent Forms、Ninja Forms、Formidable Forms、Forminator 或 Gravity Forms，或者粘贴其他表单的短代码。','The form plugin keeps the fields, e-mails and entries; this block gives the form your look.'=>'字段、邮件和提交记录仍由表单插件管理；此区块为表单套用您的外观。','Form plugin'=>'表单插件','Form shortcode'=>'表单短代码','One shortcode only, for example [my_form id="3"]. The fields get the look of the block; how well depends on the form plugin.'=>'仅限一个短代码，例如 [my_form id="3"]。字段会套用区块的外观，效果取决于表单插件。','Form'=>'表单','This plugin has no published form yet. Make one in its menu and come back.'=>'此插件还没有已发布的表单。请在插件菜单中创建表单后再回来。','This form plugin is not active.'=>'此表单插件未启用。','Fields'=>'字段','Field style'=>'字段样式','Filled'=>'填充','Line under the field'=>'字段下方的线条','One column'=>'一栏','Two columns (short fields side by side)'=>'两列（短字段并排）','Label size (px, 0 = as the text)'=>'标签大小（px，0 = 与正文相同）','Corner radius'=>'圆角','Space inside the fields'=>'字段内边距','Border width'=>'边框粗细','Space between the fields'=>'字段间距','Width'=>'宽度','By the text'=>'按文字宽度','Corner radius (-1 = as the theme buttons)'=>'圆角（-1 = 与主题按钮相同）','Labels and fields'=>'标签和字段','Field text'=>'字段文字','Field background'=>'字段背景','Field border'=>'字段边框','Active field, checkboxes'=>'当前字段、复选框','Button colors'=>'按钮颜色','Background on hover'=>'悬停时的背景','Text on hover'=>'悬停时的文字','Sent'=>'已发送','Errors'=>'错误','Languages'=>'语言','Shows the languages of WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress, in their order. Each link opens the same page in the other language.'=>'按顺序显示 WPML、Polylang 或 TranslatePress 的语言。每个链接都会以另一种语言打开同一页面。','Row of links'=>'一行链接','Flag and name'=>'国旗和名称','Flag'=>'国旗','Flag and code'=>'国旗和代码','Code (EN, DE)'=>'代码（EN、DE）','Flag shape'=>'国旗形状','Rectangle'=>'矩形','Circle'=>'圆形','Hide the current language'=>'隐藏当前语言','Hide languages without a translation of the page'=>'隐藏没有该页面翻译的语言','WPML and Polylang: otherwise such a language links to its home page.'=>'WPML 和 Polylang：否则该语言会链接到它的首页。','Menu opens to the'=>'菜单展开方向','Right (aligned left)'=>'向右（左对齐）','Left (aligned right)'=>'向左（右对齐）','Current language and hover'=>'当前语言和悬停','Menu background'=>'菜单背景','Menu text'=>'菜单文字','Switch'=>'开关','Visitors choose whether the prices are shown with or without tax; every price of the store follows. Shows only when WooCommerce calculates taxes. More in Envo Blocks › Settings › Tax Switcher.'=>'访客可选择以含税或不含税显示价格；商店中的每个价格都会随之变化。仅在 WooCommerce 计算税费时显示。详见“Envo Blocks › 设置 › 含税切换”。','Two buttons'=>'两个按钮','Order of the options'=>'选项顺序','With tax first'=>'含税在前','Without tax first'=>'不含税在前','Text for prices with tax'=>'含税价格的文字','Empty = "Incl. VAT" (or "Incl. Tax", by the country of the store).'=>'留空 =“含增值税”（或根据商店所在国家显示“含税”）。','Text for prices without tax'=>'不含税价格的文字','Empty = "Excl. VAT" (or "Excl. Tax").'=>'留空 =“不含增值税”（或“不含税”）。','Show a label'=>'显示标签','Label'=>'标签','Active background'=>'当前选项背景','Active text'=>'当前选项文字','Summer collection'=>'夏季系列','Light fabrics and bright colors for warm days.'=>'轻薄面料与明快色彩，适合温暖的日子。','Shop now'=>'立即选购','Choose an image or a video'=>'选择图片或视频','Replace the background'=>'替换背景','Remove the background'=>'移除背景','Focal point'=>'焦点','Alternative text'=>'替代文本','Describe the image if it says something the text does not; leave it empty for a decorative background.'=>'如果图片表达了文字中没有的内容，请描述它；装饰性背景请留空。','Overlay opacity (%)'=>'遮罩不透明度（%）','A darker overlay keeps light text readable on any photo. Its color is under Styles.'=>'较深的遮罩可让浅色文字在任何照片上都清晰易读。其颜色在“样式”中设置。','Parallax'=>'视差','Effect while scrolling'=>'滚动时的效果','Parallax (the background moves slower)'=>'视差（背景移动得更慢）','Zoom (the background grows)'=>'缩放（背景逐渐放大）','None (a still background)'=>'无（静止的背景）','Strength'=>'强度','Reverse (from bigger to normal)'=>'反向（从放大到正常）','Reverse (the background moves faster than the page)'=>'反向（背景比页面移动得更快）','Also on phones'=>'手机上也显示','Off: a still background on screens up to 781 px.'=>'关闭：在 781 px 及以下的屏幕上背景保持静止。','The effect runs on the site; the editor shows a still background. Visitors who turned on "reduce motion" in their system see a still background too.'=>'效果在网站上运行；编辑器中显示静止的背景。在系统中开启“减弱动态效果”的访客也会看到静止的背景。','Size and content'=>'尺寸和内容','Minimum height'=>'最小高度','Minimum height (% of the screen)'=>'最小高度（屏幕的 %）','Minimum height (px)'=>'最小高度（px）','Content width (px)'=>'内容宽度（px）','0 = the content width of the theme.'=>'0 = 主题的内容宽度。','Content position'=>'内容位置','Overlay'=>'遮罩','Background without an image'=>'无图片时的背景','On this page'=>'本页内容','Overview'=>'概览','Details'=>'详情','Sticking'=>'固定','The blocks stay in view inside the column or group this block is in, until its end. Put it in the shorter column of a Columns block. The editor shows it without sticking.'=>'这些区块会在本区块所在的栏或组中保持可见，直到其末尾。请把它放在分栏区块中较短的一栏里。编辑器中显示为不固定。','Space at the top'=>'顶部间距','Below a sticky header (automatic)'=>'在固定页眉下方（自动）','From the top of the screen'=>'从屏幕顶部开始','Extra space (px)'=>'额外间距（px）','Space from the top (px)'=>'距顶部的距离（px）','Space at the bottom (px)'=>'底部间距（px）','For content taller than the screen: it floats – while scrolling down it stops this far above the bottom, while scrolling up at the top.'=>'内容高于屏幕时：它会浮动——向下滚动时停在距底部这么远的位置，向上滚动时停在顶部。','Sticky on'=>'固定于','Computers and tablets'=>'电脑和平板','Computers only'=>'仅电脑','Every screen, phones too'=>'所有屏幕，包括手机','Documentation'=>'文档','Contact support'=>'联系支持','There is nothing to export. Add some blocks first.'=>'没有可导出的内容。请先添加一些区块。','Preparing the ZIP file with the images…'=>'正在准备包含图片的 ZIP 文件…','Page exported as ZIP with %d image.'=>'页面已导出为包含 %d 张图片的 ZIP。','Page exported as JSON.'=>'页面已导出为 JSON。','This will replace the current content of the page. Continue?'=>'这将替换页面的当前内容。是否继续？','Buy PRO'=>'购买 PRO','Activate License'=>'激活许可证','Renew License'=>'续订许可证','PRO'=>'PRO','%d more page'=>'还有 %d 个页面','%1$s: %2$d more pages'=>'%1$s：还有 %2$d 个页面','%1$s: page %2$s'=>'%1$s：第 %2$s 页','Open template %s'=>'打开模板 %s','%d page'=>'%d 个页面','Live demo'=>'在线演示','Choose pages'=>'选择页面','Select'=>'选择','Active'=>'已启用','Installed, not active'=>'已安装，未启用','Not installed'=>'未安装','Download ZIP'=>'下载 ZIP','Then upload it in Appearance > Themes > Add New > Upload Theme.'=>'然后在 外观 > 主题 > 添加新主题 > 上传主题 中上传。','Then upload it in Plugins > Add New > Upload Plugin.'=>'然后在 插件 > 添加新插件 > 上传插件 中上传。','Install & activate'=>'安装并启用','Install'=>'安装','Activate'=>'启用','Ask an administrator'=>'请联系管理员','%s – the theme our templates are made for'=>'%s – 我们的模板专为此主题打造','A free block theme for WooCommerce. With it the templates look exactly like the demos; with another theme the fonts, spacing and shop pages can look different.'=>'一款适用于 WooCommerce 的免费区块主题。使用它，模板看起来与演示完全一致；使用其他主题时，字体、间距和商店页面可能会有所不同。','A free block theme for WooCommerce from WordPress.org. With it the templates look exactly like the demos; with another theme the fonts, spacing and shop pages can look different. Your pages and products stay when you switch.'=>'一款来自 WordPress.org、适用于 WooCommerce 的免费区块主题。使用它，模板看起来与演示完全一致；使用其他主题时，字体、间距和商店页面可能会有所不同。切换主题后，您的页面和产品都会保留。','Store in 5 minutes'=>'5 分钟开店','Hide'=>'隐藏','Import the header and footer of the template'=>'导入模板的页眉和页脚','The page gets the header and footer of the demo store.'=>'页面将使用演示商店的页眉和页脚。','Only the content between them is imported; the page shows the header and footer of your theme.'=>'仅导入两者之间的内容；页面显示您主题的页眉和页脚。','Canvas page: the header and footer of your theme are not shown, only the imported content.'=>'画布页面：不显示您主题的页眉和页脚，仅显示导入的内容。','This template has its own header and footer.'=>'此模板有自己的页眉和页脚。','This template has its own header and footer. Choose a canvas page template, otherwise the header and footer of your theme are shown as well.'=>'此模板有自己的页眉和页脚。请选择画布页面模板，否则您主题的页眉和页脚也会显示。','This template has its own header and footer, and your theme has no canvas template for this type of content: the header and footer of your theme are shown as well. You can delete either of them after the import.'=>'此模板有自己的页眉和页脚，而您的主题没有适用于此类内容的画布模板：您主题的页眉和页脚也会显示。导入后可以删除其中之一。','Page template'=>'页面模板','canvas'=>'画布','Import "%s"'=>'导入“%s”','Importing…'=>'正在导入…','Reload the editor and import'=>'重新加载编辑器并导入','Preview of %s'=>'%s 的预览','No preview image'=>'无预览图片','Pages of the template'=>'模板的页面','All templates'=>'所有模板','Only the layout, texts and settings of the page are imported. Products, categories, reviews, coupons and other dynamic content are not imported: the blocks load the content of your own store.'=>'仅导入页面的布局、文本和设置。产品、分类、评价、优惠券和其他动态内容不会导入：区块会加载您自己商店的内容。','Required plugins'=>'必需插件','The pages use blocks of these plugins. They must be active before you import.'=>'这些页面使用了以下插件的区块。导入前必须启用它们。','Recommended plugins'=>'推荐插件','Recommended theme'=>'推荐主题','The template was designed with this theme. Activating a theme changes the look of the whole site.'=>'此模板是使用该主题设计的。启用主题会改变整个网站的外观。','Activate the required plugins first: %s.'=>'请先启用必需插件：%s。','This is a PRO template. Activate your PRO license to preview and import it.'=>'这是 PRO 模板。请激活您的 PRO 许可证以预览和导入。','This is a PRO template. Your PRO license has expired; renew it to preview and import the template.'=>'这是 PRO 模板。您的 PRO 许可证已过期；请续订以预览和导入该模板。','This is a PRO template. It is included in Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'这是 PRO 模板。它包含在 Envo Blocks PRO 中。','Importing creates a new draft post or page with this content and opens it in the editor. Nothing else on your site changes.'=>'导入会使用此内容创建新的草稿文章或页面，并在编辑器中打开。网站上的其他内容不会改变。','Importing replaces the current content of the page you are editing. To add only a part of a page, use Sections.'=>'导入会替换您正在编辑的页面的当前内容。如果只想添加页面的一部分，请使用“区段”。','New plugins were activated. The editor reloads to load their blocks; your changes are saved as a draft first.'=>'新插件已启用。编辑器将重新加载以加载它们的区块；您的更改会先保存为草稿。','Opens this page in a new tab with your theme and your products, without changing the page you are editing.'=>'在新标签页中以您的主题和产品打开此页面，不会更改您正在编辑的页面。','Preparing…'=>'正在准备…','Preview'=>'预览','Open the live demo'=>'打开在线演示','PRO – activate your license'=>'PRO – 请激活您的许可证','PRO – license expired'=>'PRO – 许可证已过期','Included in Envo Blocks PRO'=>'包含在 Envo Blocks PRO 中','Live demo of %s (opens in a new tab)'=>'%s 的在线演示（在新标签页中打开）','Use %s'=>'使用 %s','Insert %s'=>'插入 %s','Needs %s'=>'需要 %s','Creating…'=>'正在创建…','Use'=>'使用','Inserting…'=>'正在插入…','Insert'=>'插入','Free or PRO'=>'免费或 PRO','All'=>'全部','Free'=>'免费','Show all'=>'显示全部','Categories'=>'分类','It does not contain anything that can be used on this site.'=>'其中没有可在此网站上使用的内容。','"%s" inserted.'=>'已插入“%s”。','This makes a new store layout and opens it. Changes of this page that are not saved are lost. Go on?'=>'这将创建新的商店布局并打开它。此页面未保存的更改将丢失。是否继续？','The layout could not be created.'=>'无法创建布局。','Activate the theme "%s"? It changes the look of the whole site.'=>'启用主题“%s”？这会改变整个网站的外观。','The template does not contain any usable blocks.'=>'该模板不包含任何可用的区块。','The preview could not be created.'=>'无法创建预览。','"%s" imported.'=>'已导入“%s”。','The file could not be read.'=>'无法读取该文件。','The file does not contain any usable blocks.'=>'该文件不包含任何可用的区块。','What to import'=>'导入内容','Templates'=>'模板','Sections'=>'区段','Presets'=>'预设','Layouts'=>'布局','Designs of the product page, the shop, the cart, the side cart, the checkout, the order received page and My account. "Use" makes a store layout of the design and opens it; it is used on the 