es are made for – the store will look exactly like the demo.'=>'我们的模板专为此主题制作 – 商店看起来会和演示完全一样。','Continue'=>'继续','(current)'=>'（当前）','Strongly recommended'=>'强烈推荐','Our templates are designed with this theme. Choose it and your store looks exactly like the demo you pick – from the first click.'=>'我们的模板是用这个主题设计的。选择它，您的商店从第一次点击起就和所选演示完全一样。','Fonts, spacing and buttons match the template 1:1'=>'字体、间距和按钮与模板完全一致','Shop, product, cart and checkout pages in the same style'=>'商店、商品、购物车和结账页面风格统一','Your brand colour reaches every page, not only the home page'=>'品牌色覆盖每个页面，而不只是首页','Free, made by us – tested with every Envo Blocks release'=>'免费，由我们制作 – 随每个 Envo Blocks 版本测试','Install and use %s'=>'安装并使用 %s','Free from WordPress.org – installed and activated for you.'=>'从 WordPress.org 免费获取 – 我们会为您安装并启用。','The theme is not installed on this site yet. Ask an administrator to install it.'=>'此站点尚未安装该主题。请联系管理员安装。','The theme is not installed on this site yet.'=>'此站点尚未安装该主题。','How to get the theme ↗'=>'如何获取主题 ↗','Your current theme: %s. You can switch back any time in Appearance › Themes.'=>'您当前的主题：%s。您可以随时在“外观 › 主题”中切换回来。','Try your luck with another theme'=>'试试其他主题','The template brings its own header and footer, so it will work. Fonts, spacing and the shop pages come from the theme, though, and may not match. Not happy with the result? You can switch to Envo Blocks Store later with one click.'=>'模板自带页眉和页脚，因此可以正常使用。但字体、间距和商店页面来自主题，可能不太匹配。对结果不满意？以后可以一键切换到 Envo Blocks Store。','Continue with this theme'=>'继续使用此主题','No thanks, I will try my luck with another theme'=>'不用了，我想试试其他主题','%1$d of %2$d templates'=>'%1$d / %2$d 个模板','%d templates'=>'%d 个模板','Activate your PRO license'=>'激活您的 PRO 许可证','Renew your PRO license'=>'续订您的 PRO 许可证','Needs Envo Blocks PRO'=>'需要 Envo Blocks PRO','%d pages: %s'=>'%d 个页面：%s','Use this template'=>'使用此模板','Live demo ↗'=>'在线演示 ↗','Pick the template closest to your store. Your products are put into it, and you change the colours in the next step.'=>'选择最接近您商店的模板。您的商品会放入其中，颜色在下一步更改。','Search templates – fashion, electronics, dark, sport…'=>'搜索模板 – 时尚、电子、深色、运动…','No template matches. Try another word or show all.'=>'没有匹配的模板。请换个词或显示全部。','← Back'=>'← 返回','Template colour'=>'模板颜色','Text on it: %1$s, contrast %2$s:1'=>'其上的文字：%1$s，对比度 %2$s:1','Preview with %s. The template was designed for Envo Blocks Store.'=>'使用 %s 预览。此模板是为 Envo Blocks Store 设计的。','See it with Envo Blocks Store'=>'用 Envo Blocks Store 查看','Drag to move'=>'拖动以移动','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'第 %1$d 步，共 %2$d 步','Show options'=>'显示选项','Fold the options'=>'收起选项','Preview page'=>'预览页面','Desktop'=>'桌面端','Phone'=>'电话','Previous page'=>'上一页','Home (front page)'=>'首页（首页）','Next page'=>'下一页','Store name'=>'商店名称','Shown in the header instead of the template’s name.'=>'在页眉中代替模板名称显示。','Brand colour'=>'品牌色','Second accent'=>'第二强调色','Light and dark shades and the text on coloured buttons are worked out for you, so everything stays readable.'=>'浅色和深色色调以及彩色按钮上的文字都会自动计算，确保所有内容清晰可读。','Back to the template colours'=>'恢复模板颜色','← Template'=>'← 模板','Next: what to import →'=>'下一步：导入内容 →','Logo'=>'标志','Upload or choose logo…'=>'上传或选择标志…','Without a logo the store name is shown in the template’s lettering.'=>'没有标志时，商店名称会以模板的字体显示。','Change logo…'=>'更换标志…','Use the name instead'=>'改用名称','Logo of your store'=>'您商店的标志','Use as logo'=>'用作标志','%1$d of %2$d pages chosen'=>'已选择 %1$d / %2$d 个页面','Clear all'=>'全部清除','Choose all'=>'全选','Use it for the whole site'=>'用于整个站点','Every page gets it – also the shop, product, cart, checkout and blog pages. It replaces the theme’s own; you can edit it later in Appearance › Editor.'=>'每个页面都会使用它 – 包括商店、商品、购物车、结账和博客页面。它会替换主题自带的；以后可以在“外观 › 编辑器”中编辑。','Only on the imported pages'=>'仅用于导入的页面','The other pages keep the theme’s own.'=>'其他页面保留主题自带的。','Don’t import it'=>'不导入','All pages keep the theme’s own.'=>'所有页面保留主题自带的。','(This template has none.)'=>'（此模板没有。）','Recommended'=>'推荐','Choose what goes into your store. You can add the other pages later by running the wizard again.'=>'选择要放入商店的内容。以后可以再次运行向导添加其他页面。','Pages'=>'页面','Links of the template to pages you leave out go to the front page.'=>'模板中指向您未选页面的链接将指向首页。','Home'=>'首页','Front page'=>'首页','Without Home your front page stays as it is now.'=>'不选首页时，您的首页保持现状。','Header'=>'页眉','Logo, menu, search, cart and the bar above them.'=>'标志、菜单、搜索、购物车及其上方的横条。','Footer'=>'页脚','Links, contacts and payment icons at the bottom.'=>'底部的链接、联系方式和支付图标。','← Colours'=>'← 颜色','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Build my store'=>'创建我的商店','WooCommerce is not active – there is nothing to set up here.'=>'WooCommerce 未启用 – 这里没有需要设置的内容。','A few basics of your shop. Everything can be changed later in WooCommerce › Settings – or skip this step.'=>'商店的几项基本设置。以后都可以在“WooCommerce › 设置”中更改 – 也可以跳过此步骤。','Country and currency'=>'国家和货币','Filled in from the language of your site. Prices are shown the way that country writes them.'=>'根据您站点的语言填写。价格会按照该国家的写法显示。','Your store is in'=>'您的商店所在国家','Currency'=>'货币','Store address'=>'商店地址','optional – for invoices, e-mails and taxes'=>'可选 – 用于发票、邮件和税费','Address line 1'=>'地址第 1 行','Address line 2 (optional)'=>'地址第 2 行（可选）','City'=>'城市','Postcode'=>'邮政编码','State / region'=>'省份 / 地区','Shown on invoices and in the order e-mails; WooCommerce also counts taxes from it. The country is the one chosen above.'=>'显示在发票和订单邮件中；WooCommerce 也会据此计算税费。国家为上方所选。','Payments'=>'付款','Bank transfer with a QR code'=>'带二维码的银行转账','The customer scans the QR code on the thank-you page or in the order e-mail and the payment is filled in for them.'=>'顾客在感谢页面或订单邮件中扫描二维码，付款信息会自动填好。','Account holder'=>'账户持有人','BIC / SWIFT (optional)'=>'BIC / SWIFT（可选）','Without an IBAN the transfer is on, but there is no QR code yet.'=>'没有 IBAN 时银行转账仍会启用，但暂时没有二维码。','Cash on delivery'=>'货到付款','The customer pays the courier.'=>'顾客向快递员付款。','Delivery within %s'=>'%s 境内配送','One shipping zone with a price and free delivery from an amount. The free shipping bar of your template shows this amount by itself.'=>'一个配送区域，设置运费和满额免运费。模板中的免运费横条会自动显示这个金额。','Free from'=>'满额免运费','Leave “Free from” empty for no free delivery.'=>'如果不提供免运费，请将“满额免运费”留空。','Sample products'=>'示例商品','Your store already has %d sample products.'=>'您的商店已有 %d 个示例商品。','Add 6 sample products'=>'添加 6 个示例商品','So the template’s product blocks are not empty while you add your own. Named “Sample product – …”, in the category “Sample products”, with the WooCommerce placeholder picture. Your store has %d products now.'=>'这样在您添加自己的商品之前，模板的商品区块不会是空的。名称为“示例商品 – …”，位于“示例商品”分类中，使用 WooCommerce 的占位图片。您的商店现有 %d 个商品。','Later one click deletes all samples you did not edit; an edited sample stays as your product.'=>'以后一键即可删除所有未编辑的示例；编辑过的示例会作为您的商品保留。','Store pages'=>'商店页面','The pages WooCommerce uses for the shop, cart, checkout and customer accounts, and the terms and privacy policy the checkout links to. Pick your own page or let the wizard create one.'=>'WooCommerce 用于商店、购物车、结账和顾客账户的页面，以及结账页面链接到的条款和隐私政策。选择您自己的页面，或让向导创建一个。','Skip this step'=>'跳过此步骤','Save and finish'=>'保存并完成','Your store is ready'=>'您的商店已准备就绪','The pages are published, the template home page is your front page and the brand colours are set for the whole site.'=>'页面已发布，模板的首页已成为您的首页，品牌色已应用到整个站点。','View my store ↗'=>'查看我的商店 ↗','Edit the home page'=>'编辑首页','Change colours'=>'更改颜色','Not happy with the result?'=>'对结果不满意？','Try %s'=>'试试 %s','Your template was made for our theme. With %s the fonts, spacing and shop pages can look different from the demo. One click switches the theme – your pages, products and colours stay.'=>'您的模板是为我们的主题制作的。使用 %s 时，字体、间距和商店页面可能与演示不同。一键即可切换主题 – 您的页面、商品和颜色都会保留。','Switch to %s'=>'切换到 %s','You can switch back any time in Appearance › Themes.'=>'您可以随时在“外观 › 主题”中切换回来。','Set up your store'=>'设置您的商店','Country and currency, bank transfer with a QR code, cash on delivery, delivery prices with free delivery, sample products.'=>'国家和货币、带二维码的银行转账、货到付款、含免运费的运费、示例商品。','Set up the store →'=>'设置商店 →','Sample products in your store: %1$d (not edited: %2$d).'=>'您商店中的示例商品：%1$d 个（未编辑：%2$d 个）。','Delete the unedited sample products (%d)'=>'删除未编辑的示例商品（%d）','Samples you edited stay – they are your products now.'=>'您编辑过的示例会保留 – 它们现在是您的商品。','Undo everything the wizard did'=>'撤消向导所做的一切','Puts back your theme, front page, store name and colours; the template pages go to the trash.'=>'恢复您的主题、首页、商店名称和颜色；模板页面移至回收站。','More store settings'=>'更多商店设置','Everything the wizard set and much more – whenever you need it.'=>'向导设置的一切以及更多 – 随时可用。','Store layouts'=>'商店布局','Your own design of the product page, shop, cart, checkout, side cart, thank-you page and My account – built from blocks, for the whole store or only some products and categories.'=>'为商品页面、商店、购物车、结账、侧边购物车、感谢页面和“我的账户”打造您自己的设计 – 由区块构建，适用于整个商店或仅部分商品和分类。','Open Store Layouts →'=>'打开商店布局 →','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Envo Blocks'=>'Envo Blocks','Installing %s from WordPress.org…'=>'正在从 WordPress.org 安装 %s…','Switching the theme…'=>'正在切换主题…','Preparing %s…'=>'正在准备 %s…','Page %1$d of %2$d: %3$s – matching your products and copying images'=>'第 %1$d / %2$d 页：%3$s – 正在匹配您的商品并复制图片','Building your store…'=>'正在创建您的商店…','Setting up your store…'=>'正在设置您的商店…','Your store settings are saved.'=>'您的商店设置已保存。','Deleting the sample products…'=>'正在删除示例商品…','Sample products deleted: %d.'=>'已删除的示例商品：%d 个。','Kept because you edited them: %d.'=>'因您编辑过而保留：%d 个。','Checking what goes back…'=>'正在检查要恢复的内容…','Undoing…'=>'正在撤消…','Undo everything the wizard did?'=>'撤消向导所做的一切？','You changed these after the wizard – undo replaces your changes:'=>'您在向导之后更改了以下内容 – 撤消会覆盖您的更改：','What goes back:'=>'将恢复的内容：','Nothing to put back.'=>'没有需要恢复的内容。','Pictures copied into the Media Library stay there. Pages and products go to the trash, so you can restore them.'=>'复制到媒体库的图片会保留。页面和商品会移至回收站，您可以从那里恢复。','Keep everything'=>'全部保留','Undo anyway'=>'仍然撤消','Undo everything'=>'全部撤消','block title' . "\4" . 'Active Filters'=>'已选筛选','block description' . "\4" . 'The chosen filters of the shop as chips – a click removes one – and "Clear all". Shown only while a filter is on.'=>'以标签显示商店中已选的筛选条件——点击一个即可移除——以及“全部清除”。仅在启用筛选时显示。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'filters'=>'筛选','block keyword' . "\4" . 'active filters'=>'已选筛选','block keyword' . "\4" . 'chosen'=>'已选','block keyword' . "\4" . 'clear'=>'清除','block keyword' . "\4" . 'shop'=>'商店','block keyword' . "\4" . 'woocommerce'=>'woocommerce','block title' . "\4" . 'Advanced Heading'=>'高级标题','block description' . "\4" . 'A heading made of three parts, each with its own typography, colors, background and border. The middle part can rotate several texts with an animation.'=>'由三部分组成的标题，每部分都有自己的排版、颜色、背景和边框。中间部分可以用动画轮换多段文本。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'heading'=>'标题','block keyword' . "\4" . 'title'=>'标题文字','block keyword' . "\4" . 'animated'=>'动画','block keyword' . "\4" . 'rotating'=>'轮换','block keyword' . "\4" . 'typing'=>'打字','block keyword' . "\4" . 'headline'=>'大标题','Enter the texts of the heading in the block settings.'=>'请在区块设置中输入标题的文本。','block title' . "\4" . 'Announcement Bar'=>'公告栏','block description' . "\4" . 'A thin bar for shipping offers, sales and news: messages that take turns, scroll as a ticker or sit side by side, with links, icons and a close button that the browser remembers.'=>'用于配送优惠、促销和新闻的细长栏：消息可轮流显示、像跑马灯一样滚动或并排显示，带有链接、图标和浏览器会记住的关闭按钮。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'announcement'=>'公告','block keyword' . "\4" . 'notice'=>'通知','block keyword' . "\4" . 'top bar'=>'顶部栏','block keyword' . "\4" . 'marquee'=>'跑马灯','block keyword' . "\4" . 'ticker'=>'滚动字幕','block keyword' . "\4" . 'banner'=>'横幅','block keyword' . "\4" . 'promo'=>'促销','Add a message in the block settings.'=>'请在区块设置中添加消息。','Announcements'=>'公告','Previous message'=>'上一条消息','Next message'=>'下一条消息','Close the announcement'=>'关闭公告','block title' . "\4" . 'Cart Items'=>'购物车商品','block description' . "\4" . 'The products in the cart with images, quantities and remove buttons, for side cart layouts. Loaded in the browser, so cached pages stay right.'=>'购物车中的产品，带图片、数量和移除按钮，用于侧边购物车布局。在浏览器中加载，因此缓存页面也能保持正确。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'car