ize'=>'尺码','block keyword' . "\4" . 'category'=>'分类','block keyword' . "\4" . 'rating'=>'评分','block keyword' . "\4" . 'stock'=>'库存','block keyword' . "\4" . 'layered navigation'=>'分层导航','block title' . "\4" . 'Product Questions'=>'商品问答','block description' . "\4" . 'Questions and answers of a product: customers ask, you answer in Envo Blocks › Settings › Product Questions, the answered questions show here with a search.'=>'商品的问题与回答：顾客提问，您在“Envo Blocks › 设置 › 商品问答”中回答，已回答的问题在此显示并可搜索。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'q&a'=>'问答','block keyword' . "\4" . 'ask'=>'提问','block keyword' . "\4" . 'product'=>'产品','The questions of the current product are shown here on the product page.'=>'在商品页面上，当前商品的问题显示在这里。','block title' . "\4" . 'Product Tab'=>'产品选项卡','block description' . "\4" . 'One tab of the Product Tabs block: a part of WooCommerce (description, additional information, reviews), own content made of blocks, the product\'s own tabs or the tabs of other plugins.'=>'Product Tabs 区块中的一个选项卡：WooCommerce 的一部分（描述、附加信息、评价）、由区块组成的自定义内容、产品自身的选项卡或其他插件的选项卡。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'tab'=>'选项卡','block keyword' . "\4" . 'product tab'=>'产品选项卡','block title' . "\4" . 'Product Tabs'=>'产品选项卡','block description' . "\4" . 'The tabs of the product page in your order and design: description, additional information, reviews, own tabs made of blocks and the product\'s own tabs. Tabs on top, left or right, or an accordion.'=>'按您的顺序和设计显示产品页面的选项卡：描述、附加信息、评价、由区块组成的自定义选项卡和产品自身的选项卡。选项卡可在顶部、左侧或右侧，或显示为手风琴。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'tabs'=>'选项卡','block keyword' . "\4" . 'product tabs'=>'产品选项卡','block keyword' . "\4" . 'description'=>'描述','block keyword' . "\4" . 'reviews'=>'评价','block keyword' . "\4" . 'additional information'=>'附加信息','The tabs of the current product are shown here on the product page.'=>'当前产品的选项卡将显示在产品页面的此处。','block title' . "\4" . 'Rating Summary'=>'评分摘要','block description' . "\4" . 'Average rating with stars and a breakdown of the 5★ to 1★ reviews, for the current product, a chosen product or the whole shop.'=>'当前产品、所选产品或整个商店的平均星级评分，以及 5★ 到 1★ 评价的分布。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'stars'=>'星级','block keyword' . "\4" . 'histogram'=>'直方图','block keyword' . "\4" . 'breakdown'=>'分布','The rating of the current product is shown here on the product page.'=>'当前产品的评分将显示在产品页面的此处。','Based on %s review'=>'基于 %s 条评价','No reviews yet'=>'暂无评价','Write a review'=>'撰写评价','%1$d star: %2$s review'=>'%1$d 星：%2$s 条评价','block title' . "\4" . 'Recently Viewed Products'=>'最近浏览的产品','block description' . "\4" . 'Products the visitor looked at last. They are remembered in the browser and loaded through the WooCommerce Store API, so the block works on cached pages too.'=>'访客最近浏览的产品。记录在浏览器中并通过 WooCommerce Store API 加载，因此该区块在缓存页面上也能正常工作。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'recently'=>'最近','block keyword' . "\4" . 'viewed'=>'浏览过','block keyword' . "\4" . 'history'=>'记录','block keyword' . "\4" . 'products'=>'产品','Rated %s out of 5'=>'评分 %s，满分 5','There are no products yet. Visitors will see the products they viewed last.'=>'还没有产品。访客将看到他们最近浏览的产品。','Clear history'=>'清除记录','block title' . "\4" . 'Customer Photos'=>'顾客照片','block description' . "\4" . 'The photos customers added to their reviews, as a gallery: a click opens the photo with the stars and the words of the review. For the current product, a chosen product or the whole shop.'=>'顾客在评价中添加的照片，以图库形式展示：点击即可打开照片，并显示星级和评价内容。可用于当前商品、所选商品或整个商店。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'photos'=>'照片','block keyword' . "\4" . 'customer photos'=>'顾客照片','block keyword' . "\4" . 'user generated'=>'用户生成内容','block keyword' . "\4" . 'ugc'=>'ugc','block keyword' . "\4" . 'gallery'=>'图库','The photos of the current product are shown here on the product page.'=>'在商品页面上，当前商品的照片显示在这里。','Verified owner'=>'已验证购买者','Photo from the review of %s'=>'来自 %s 评价的照片','block title' . "\4" . 'Free Shipping Progress'=>'免运费进度','block description' . "\4" . 'A bar that shows how much is missing in the cart for free shipping. It updates when the cart changes.'=>'显示购物车距离免运费还差多少金额的进度条。购物车变化时会更新。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'free'=>'免费','block keyword' . "\4" . 'progress'=>'进度','Set the amount for free shipping in the block settings (or add a "Free shipping" method with a minimum order amount).'=>'请在区块设置中设置免运费金额（或添加带最低订单金额的“免运费”方式）。','Progress to free shipping'=>'免运费进度','block title' . "\4" . 'Shop Toolbar'=>'商店工具栏','block description' . "\4" . 'The number of products found and the sorting menu of the shop and the product categories, for shop layouts.'=>'显示找到的产品数量以及商店和产品分类的排序菜单，用于商店布局。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'sorting'=>'排序','block keyword' . "\4" . 'order by'=>'排序方式','block keyword' . "\4" . 'result count'=>'结果数量','block keyword' . "\4" . 'toolbar'=>'工具栏','Showing 1–12 of 48 results'=>'显示 48 个结果中的第 1–12 个','Shop order'=>'商店排序','Default sorting'=>'默认排序','block title' . "\4" . 'Size Guide'=>'尺码指南','block description' . "\4" . 'A link or button that opens the size chart in a pop-up window. The content of the window is made of normal blocks (table, image, text).'=>'在弹出窗口中打开尺码表的链接或按钮。窗口内容由普通区块（表格、图片、文本）组成。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'chart'=>'表格','block keyword' . "\4" . 'guide'=>'指南','block keyword' . "\4" . 'modal'=>'弹窗','block keyword' . "\4" . 'popup'=>'弹出窗口','block title' . "\4" . 'Sticky Column'=>'固定栏','block description' . "\4" . 'Blocks that stay in view while the page scrolls – inside their column or group, like a sticky sidebar. A tall one floats up and down with the scrolling.'=>'页面滚动时保持可见的区块——在所在的栏或组中，就像固定侧边栏。较高的内容会随滚动上下浮动。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'sticky'=>'粘性','block keyword' . "\4" . 'sidebar'=>'侧边栏','block keyword' . "\4" . 'fixed'=>'固定','block keyword' . "\4" . 'column'=>'栏','block keyword' . "\4" . 'table of contents'=>'目录','block keyword' . "\4" . 'summary'=>'摘要','block title' . "\4" . 'Stock Indicator'=>'库存指示器','block description' . "\4" . '"Only 3 left in stock" with a bar, from the real stock of the product (WooCommerce stock management). For variable products it follows the chosen variation.'=>'根据产品的真实库存（WooCommerce 库存管理）显示“仅剩 3 件”及进度条。对于可变产品，会跟随所选的变体。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'inventory'=>'存货','block keyword' . "\4" . 'scarcity'=>'稀缺','block keyword' . "\4" . 'left'=>'剩余','block keyword' . "\4" . 'quantity'=>'数量','The stock of the current product is shown here on the product page.'=>'当前产品的库存将显示在产品页面的此处。','WooCommerce does not count the stock of this product. Turn on "Manage stock?" in its Inventory settings to show how many are left.'=>'WooCommerce 未统计此产品的库存。请在其库存设置中开启“管理库存？”以显示剩余数量。','block title' . "\4" . 'Store Breadcrumbs'=>'商店面包屑','block description' . "\4" . 'The WooCommerce breadcrumbs (Home / Shop / Category / Product) for store layouts and any page.'=>'用于商店布局和任意页面的 WooCommerce 面包屑（首页 / 商店 / 分类 / 产品）。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'breadcrumbs'=>'面包屑','block keyword' . "\4" . 'path'=>'路径','block keyword' . "\4" . 'navigation'=>'导航','Breadcrumb'=>'面包屑导航','block title' . "\4" . 'Tax Switcher'=>'含税切换','block description' . "\4" . 'Lets visitors see the prices with or without tax (VAT) – a switch, two buttons or a dropdown for the header or the shop. Every price of the store follows. Shows only when WooCommerce calculates taxes.'=>'让访客查看含税或不含税（增值税）的价格——用于页眉或商店的开关、两个按钮或下拉列表。商店中的每个价格都会随之变化。仅在 WooCommerce 计算税费时显示。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'tax'=>'税','block keyword' . "\4" . 'vat'=>'增值税','block keyword' . "\4" . 'prices'=>'价格','block keyword' . "\4" . 'incl'=>'含税','block keyword' . "\4" . 'excl'=>'不含税','block keyword' . "\4" . 'net'=>'净价','block keyword' . "\4" . 'gross'=>'总价','block keyword' . "\4" . 'b2b'=>'b2b','block keyword' . "\4" . 'switch'=>'开关','block keyword' . "\4" . 'toggle'=>'切换','WooCommerce does not calculate taxes yet (or there is no tax rate), so the switch shows nothing on the site. Turn on taxes in WooCommerce › Settings › General and add the rates in WooCommerce › Settings › Tax.'=>'WooCommerce 尚未计算税费（或没有任何税率），因此切换在网站上不显示任何内容。请在“WooCommerce › 设置 › 常规”中启用税费，并在“WooCommerce › 设置 › 税”中添加税率。','Switching is off in Envo Blocks › Settings › Tax Switcher, so the switch shows nothing on the site.'=>'“Envo Blocks › 设置 › 含税切换”中的切换已关闭，因此网站上不显示任何内容。','block title' . "\4" . 'Trust Badges'=>'信任徽章','block description' . "\4" . 'Payment method icons and short guarantees (secure payment, returns, delivery) that build trust near the buy button or in the footer.'=>'支付方式图标和简短保障（安全支付、退货、配送），可放在购买按钮附近或页脚中以建立信任。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'visa'=>'visa','block keyword' . "\4" . 'paypal'=>'paypal','block keyword' . "\4" . 'guarantee'=>'保障','Choose payment methods or add a guarantee in the block settings.'=>'请在区块设置中选择支付方式或添加保障。','Accepted payment methods'=>'支持的支付方式','block title' . "\4" . 'Video Popup'=>'视频弹窗','block description' . "\4" . 'A play button, or an image with a play button, that opens a YouTube, Vimeo, Dailymotion or own video in a pop-up window. Nothing is loaded from the video site before the click.'=>'播放按钮，或带播放按钮的图片，可在弹出窗口中打开 YouTube、Vimeo、Dailymotion 或自有视频。点击前不会从视频网站加载任何内容。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'lightbox'=>'灯箱','block keyword' . "\4" . 'youtube'=>'youtube','block keyword' . "\4" . 'vimeo'=>'vimeo','block keyword' . "\4" . 'play'=>'播放','Enter the address of a YouTube, Vimeo or Dailymotion video, or choose a video file, in the block settings.'=>'请在区块设置中输入 YouTube、Vimeo 或 Dailymotion 视频的地址，或选择视频文件。','This video address is not supported. Use a YouTube, Vimeo or Dailymotion link, or a link to an mp4 / webm file.'=>'不支持此视频地址。请使用 YouTube、Vimeo 或 Dailymotion 链接，或 mp4 / webm 文件的链接。','Play video: %s'=>'播放视频：%s','Close video'=>'关闭视频','block title' . "\4" . 'Wishlist'=>'心愿单','block description' . "\4" . 'The visitor\'s wishlist for the wishlist page: products with price, stock, Add to cart and remove. A published page with this block becomes the wishlist page.'=>'用于心愿单页面的访客心愿单：带价格、库存、加入购物车和移除的产品。包含此区块的已发布页面将成为心愿单页面。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'wishlist'=>'心愿单','block keyword' . "\4" . 'favorites'=>'收藏','block keyword' . "\4" . 'saved products'=>'已保存的产品','block keyword' . "\4" . 'list'=>'列表','block title' . "\4" . 'Wishlist Button'=>'心愿单按钮','block description' . "\4" . 'A heart that adds the product to the wishlist: on the product page, in a product template, or for a chosen product. Guests keep the list in the browser, customers in their account.'=>'将产品加入心愿单的爱心：用于产品页面、产品模板或所选产品。访客的列表保存在浏览器中，顾客的保存在账户中。','block keyword' . "\4" . 'favorite'=>'收藏','block keyword' . "\4" . 'heart'=>'爱心','block keyword' . "\4" . 'save for later'=>'稍后购买','block keyword' . "\4" . 'like'=>'喜欢','block style label' . "\4" . 'Default'=>'默认','block style label' . "\4" . 'On the image'=>'图片上','Getting started'=>'入门','Installation'=>'安装','First steps'=>'第一步','Import a template'=>'导入模板','Header and footer of templates'=>'模板的页眉和页脚','Export and import a page as a file'=>'将页面导出和导入为文件','Side cart'=>'侧边购物车','Checkout layouts'=>'结账布局','Store Breadcrumbs'=>'商店面包屑','Shop Toolbar'=>'商店工具栏','Order Received'=>'订单已收到','My Account'=>'我的账户','Shop blocks'=>'商店区块','Features Bar'=>'优势栏','Trust Badges'=>'信任徽章','Delivery Estimate'=>'送达预估','Coupon Code Box'=>'优惠码框','Rating Summary'=>'评分摘要','Recently Viewed Products'=>'最近浏览的产品','Size Guide'=>'尺码指南','Stock Indicator'=>'库存指示器','Lowest Price'=>'最低价格','Order Tracking'=>'订单追踪','Payment QR Code'=>'Payment QR Code','Product Tabs'=>'产品选项卡','Free Shipping Progress'=>'免运费进度','Wishlist Button'=>'心愿单按钮','Content blocks'=>'内容区块','Advanced Heading'=>'高级标题','Pricing Table'=>'价格表','Video Popup'=>'视频弹窗','Announcement Bar'=>'公告栏','Countdown'=>'倒计时','Opening Hours'=>'营业时间','Entrance animations'=>'入场动画','Store features'=>'商店功能','PDF Invoices'=>'PDF 发票','Help'=>'帮助','Frequently asked questions'=>'常见问题','All documentation'=>'全部文档','Support forum on WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org 支持论坛','Product blocks'=>'产品区块','Products Carousel'=>'产品轮播','Slider / carousel of WooCommerce products using the default WooCommerce product look.'=>'使用 WooCommerce 默认产品外观的 WooCommerce 产品滑块 / 轮播。','Products Tabs'=>'产品选项卡','Tabs with WooCommerce products: new, featured, on sale, best sellers or a category. Each tab shows a grid or a carousel.'=>'包含 WooCommerce 产品的选项卡：新品、精选、促销、畅销或某个分类。每个选项卡显示网格或轮播。','Product List'=>'产品列表','A compact widget-like list of products in columns and rows: small image on the left, title, price and button next to it.'=>'按列和行排列的紧凑小工具式产品列表：左侧是小图片，旁边是标题、价格和按钮。','Product Mosaic'=>'产品马赛克','WooCommerce products as image tiles in aligned mosaic layouts, with the title, description, price and button placed over the image.'=>'以对齐马赛克布局的图片磁贴显示 WooCommerce 产品，标题、描述、价格和按钮叠放在图片上。','Product Split'=>'产品分屏','A selected WooCommerce product in two halves: title, short description, price and button on one side, the product image (or your own image) on the other.'=>'所选 WooCommerce 产品分成两半：一侧是标题、简短描述、价格和按钮，另一侧是产品图片（或您自己的图片）。','Product Deal'=>'产品特惠','A product on sale with a countdown to the end of the offer and a stock progress bar.'=>'促销产品，带优惠结束倒计时和库存进度条。','Product Showcase'=>'产品展示','One product at a time with a large image: a counter with a progress line, title, price, description, quantity with Add to cart and a link to the product. Up and down arrows slide to the next product.'=>'一次展示一个产品，配大图：带进度线的计数器、标题、价格、描述、带加入购物车的数量和产品链接。上下箭头切换到下一个产品。','Product Spotlight'=>'产品聚焦','Product carousel with the featured product\'s title, description, price and button on the left and the product images on the right: the active one in the middle, the others half hidden behind it. Full-width background, contained carousel.'=>'产品轮播，左侧是精选产品的标题、描述、价格和按钮，右侧是产品图片：当前图片居中，其他图片半隐藏在其后。全宽背景，轮播位于容器内。','Product Vertical Slider'=>'产品垂直滑块','WooCommerce products that slide up and down, one at a time: product image with the title, description, price and button.'=>'一次一个上下滑动的 WooCommerce 产品：带标题、描述、价格和按钮的产品图片。','Bestsellers Ranking'=>'畅销排行','A numbered ranking of the best selling products with image, price, rating and number of sold units.'=>'畅销产品的编号排行，带图片、价格、评分和已售数量。','Shop the Look'=>'买下这套造型','An image with pins. A pin opens a card of a WooCommerce product with price and add to cart.'=>'带图钉的图片。图钉会打开 WooCommerce 产品卡片，显示价格和加入购物车。','Reviews Carousel'=>'评价轮播','Slider of customer reviews of your WooCommerce products: stars, text, author and product.'=>'您的 WooCommerce 产品的顾客评价滑块：星级、内容、作者和产品。','Load More Products'=>'加载更多产品','A Load more button or infinite scroll instead of page numbers: the next products are added to the list without leaving the page. In a Product Collection, or for the shop pages from the settings.'=>'用“加载更多”按钮或无限滚动代替页码：下一批产品会添加到列表中，无需离开页面。可用于 Product Collection 中，或在设置中用于商店页面。','Category and brand blocks'=>'分类和品牌区块','Product Categories Carousel'=>'产品分类轮播','Slider / carousel of WooCommerce product categories using the default WooCommerce category look.'=>'使用 WooCommerce 默认分类外观的 WooCommerce 产品分类滑块 / 轮播。','Category Mosaic'=>'分类马赛克','Product categories as image tiles in aligned mosaic layouts: equal tiles, two wide and four squares, large and small tiles, and more.'=>'以对齐马赛克布局的图片磁贴显示产品分类：等大磁贴、两宽四方、大小磁贴等。','Category Banners'=>'分类横幅','Category tiles in mosaic layouts with a badge showing the best discount in the category ("Up to -40%") and a button.'=>'马赛克布局的分类磁贴，带显示分类最大折扣的徽章（“最高 -40%”）和按钮。','Category Split'=>'分类分屏','A WooCommerce category with its image and title on one side and products on the other side.'=>'一侧是带图片和标题的 WooCommerce 分类，另一侧是产品。','Category Showcase'=>'分类展示','A list of categories on one side and the products of the chosen category on the other, as tiles over their images.'=>'一侧是分类列表，另一侧是所选分类的产品，以磁贴形式叠放在图片上。','Brands Carousel'=>'品牌轮播','A carousel of brand logos: WooCommerce brands or your own logos with links.'=>'品牌标志轮播：WooCommerce 品牌或您自己的带链接标志。','Header and navigation'=>'页眉和导航','Mega Menu'=>'超级菜单','A navigation menu whose items open large panels with any blocks: columns of links, images, buttons, products. Items can also show a panel of a product category. Accordion or side drawer on mobile.'=>'导航菜单，其菜单项可打开包含任意区块的大面板：链接列、图片、按钮、产品。菜单项还可以显示产品分类面板。手机上为手风琴或侧边抽屉。','Category Mega Menu'=>'分类超级菜单','A menu of your product categories with large panels of subcategories, images and a promo card. Horizontal bar or a vertical "All categories" menu; an accordion on mobile.'=>'您的产品分类菜单，带有包含子分类、图片和促销卡片的大面板。水平栏或垂直“所有分类”菜单；手机上为手风琴。','Product Search (AJAX)'=>'产品搜索（AJAX）','A product search field that shows matching products with image, title and price while typing, without loading a new page.'=>'输入时显示匹配产品（含图片、标题和价格）的产品搜索栏，无需加载新页面。','Sticky Cart'=>'悬浮购物车','A cart icon with the number of items, e.g. in the header. When it scrolls out of view, a floating cart button appears in a corner of the screen; both open a cart drawer with the products, quantities, subtotal and the checkout.'=>'显示商品数量的购物车图标，例如在页眉中。滚出视野后，屏幕角落会出现悬浮购物车按钮；两者都会打开包含产品、数量、小计和结账的购物车抽屉。','Off-Canvas Panel'=>'侧滑面板','A button that opens a side panel with any blocks – a menu, product filters, contact details. Only on phones and tablets if you like; on wider screens the content then stays in the page.'=>'打开包含任意区块（菜单、产品筛选、联系方式）的侧边面板的按钮。可设置为仅在手机和平板上使用；在更宽的屏幕上内容会直接显示在页面中。','Sticky Account'=>'悬浮账户','An account icon, e.g. in the header. When it scrolls out of view, a floating account button appears; both open a panel with the account menu, or a login form for guests. Stacks next to the Sticky Cart button instead of covering it.'=>'账户图标，例如在页眉中。滚出视野后会出现悬浮账户按钮；两者都会打开包含账户菜单或访客登录表单的面板。会排在悬浮购物车按钮旁边，而不会遮住它。','Sticky Wishlist'=>'悬浮心愿单','A wishlist icon with the count, e.g. in the header. When it scrolls out of view, a floating button appears; both open a drawer with the saved products. With it on the page, the product images in lists get a heart. Builds on the free Wishlist blocks. Stacks next to the Sticky Cart and Sticky Account buttons.'=>'显示数量的心愿单图标，例如在页眉中。滚出视野后会出现悬浮按钮；两者都会打开包含已保存产品的抽屉。页面上有它时，列表中的产品图片会显示爱心。基于免费版的心愿单区块。会排在悬浮购物车和悬浮账户按钮旁边。','Wishlist, compare and product page'=>'心愿单、对比和产品页面','Compare Button'=>'对比按钮','A Compare button for the product page or a product template: the product goes to the compare bar, and the visitor compares up to four products side by side.'=>'用于产品页面或产品模板的对比按钮：产品会进入对比栏，访客最多可并排对比四个产品。','Compare Icon'=>'对比图标','A compare icon with the number of products in the comparison, e.g. in the header. A click opens the comparison window. With it on the page, the product images in lists get compare buttons.'=>'显示对比中产品数量的对比图标，例如在页眉中。点击会打开对比窗口。页面上有它时，列表中的产品图片会显示对比按钮。','Comparison Table'=>'对比表','A product comparison table: chosen products with price, rating, availability, attributes and Add to cart, one of them highlighted – or the visitor\'s own comparison on a Compare page.'=>'产品对比表：所选产品的价格、评分、库存状态、属性和加入购物车，其中一个突出显示 – 或在对比页面上显示访客自己的对比。','Variation Swatches'=>'变体样本','Color, image or size swatches of a variable product for product templates (Product Collection): hovering a color shows that variation\'s image, a click opens the product with the value selected.'=>'用于产品模板（Product Collection）的可变产品颜色、图片或尺码样本：悬停在颜色上会显示该变体的图片，点击会打开已选中该值的产品。','Variation Swatches Filter'=>'变体样本筛选','Filter products by color, size or any attribute shown as swatches – in the shop and the categories, or anywhere else as a "shop by color" link list.'=>'按以样本显示的颜色、尺码或任意属性筛选产品 – 在商店和分类中，或在其他任何地方作为“按颜色购物”链接列表。','Product Gallery (Vertical)'=>'产品图库（垂直）','The product images with the thumbnails in a column next to the main image or in a row below: swipe, zoom, full screen and the image of the chosen color. Plus a small image gallery on the product cards of lists.'=>'产品图片，缩略图在主图旁的一列或下方的一行：滑动、缩放、全屏以及所选颜色的图片。另外，列表中的产品卡片上还有小型图库。','Quick View'=>'快速查看','An eye button on the product images and a Quick View Button that open a window with the gallery, price, variations with swatches and Add to cart – without leaving the page.'=>'产品图片上的眼睛按钮和快速查看按钮，可打开包含图库、价格、带样本的变体和加入购物车的窗口 – 无需离开页面。','Product Badges'=>'产品徽章','Automatic labels on the product images – the discount in percent, Hot, Only 3 left, Sold out, New, Featured – and your own label per product. The block shows them on the product page.'=>'产品图片上的自动标签 – 折扣百分比、热卖、仅剩 3 件、售罄、新品、精选 – 以及每个产品的自定义标签。该区块在产品页面上显示它们。','Sticky Add to Cart'=>'悬浮加入购物车','A bar with the product, its price and the Add to cart button that appears when the visitor scrolls past the product\'s own button. Place it in the single product template or on any page with a chosen product.'=>'当访客滚动经过产品自身的按钮时出现的栏，显示产品、价格和加入购物车按钮。可放在单个产品模板中或任何带所选产品的页面上。','Checkout Steps'=>'结账步骤','The WooCommerce checkout in steps – details, shipping, payment – with a progress bar, Continue and Back buttons and a summary of the finished steps. For the Checkout block and the classic checkout.'=>'分步骤的 WooCommerce 结账 – 详情、配送、支付 – 带进度条、继续和返回按钮以及已完成步骤的摘要。适用于 Checkout 区块和经典结账。','Popups'=>'弹窗','Popups with any blocks – a window, a slide-in, a bar or the full screen – after some seconds, after scrolling, when leaving, after adding to the cart or with a link. Site-wide popups with rules for pages, visitors and how often.'=>'包含任意区块的弹窗 – 窗口、滑入、横栏或全屏 – 在几秒后、滚动后、离开时、加入购物车后或通过链接显示。全站弹窗可设置页面、访客和频率规则。','Sale Countdown Bar'=>'促销倒计时栏','A bar with a sale message and a countdown to a date, a time every day or a day of the week, with a coupon code that copies with a click – above the header or floating at the bottom.'=>'带促销消息和倒计时（到某个日期、每天的某个时间或一周中的某天）的栏，附带点击即可复制的优惠码 – 位于页眉上方或悬浮在底部。','Frequently Bought Together'=>'经常一起购买','The product with 1–4 products that go with it, check boxes, the total price and one "Add all to cart" button.'=>'产品及其 1–4 个搭配产品、复选框、总价和一个“全部加入购物车”按钮。','Cart Recommendations'=>'购物车推荐','Products to add from the side cart with one click: the cross-sells of the cart, best sellers, products on sale or the newest – a list, a scrolling row or two columns. For side cart layouts.'=>'可从侧边购物车一键添加的产品：购物车的交叉销售、畅销品、促销产品或最新产品 – 列表、滚动行或两列。用于侧边购物车布局。','Volume Pricing'=>'批量定价','Quantity discounts ("3+ pieces: 10 % off") set on the product, shown in a table where a click sets the quantity; the cart charges the lower price.'=>'在产品上设置的数量折扣（“3 件以上：9 折”），以表格显示，点击即可设置数量；购物车按较低价格收费。','Product Add-Ons'=>'商品附加项','Extra fields before Add to cart – engraving, gift wrap, a protection plan, accessories, a photo to print – with a price for every choice that the cart really charges. On one product or for whole categories.'=>'在“加入购物车”之前添加额外字段 – 刻字、礼品包装、延长保修、配件、待打印的照片 – 每个选择都有价格，购物车会真实计费。可用于单个商品或整个分类。','Deals & Offers'=>'优惠活动','Discount rules that run your promotions – buy 2 get 1 free, a free gift, a percent off a category, an amount off big orders, with dates and days – and a block that shows the running deals and what is missing.'=>'为您的促销运行的折扣规则 – 买 2 送 1、免费赠品、分类百分比折扣、大额订单立减，可设日期和星期 – 以及一个显示进行中优惠和还差多少的区块。','Quote Request'=>'询价请求','Request a quote for catalog products: a quote list with quantities and a form; the request becomes an order you answer with prices and a payment link.'=>'为目录商品询价：带数量的询价清单和表单；询价会变成一个订单，您用价格和付款链接回复。','Price History Chart'=>'价格历史图表','The price of a product in the last 30–365 days as a chart, with the current, lowest and highest price, from the real price history; follows the chosen variation.'=>'以图表显示产品最近 30–365 天的价格，包括当前价格、最低价格和最高价格，基于真实价格历史；跟随所选的变体。','Price Alert'=>'降价提醒','"Notify me when the price drops": visitors leave their e-mail and get one e-mail when the price of the product or the chosen variation goes down.'=>'“降价时通知我”：访客留下邮箱，当产品或所选变体降价时会收到一封邮件。','Back in Stock'=>'到货通知','"Notify me when it is available": on a product that is out of stock visitors leave their e-mail and get one e-mail when it is in stock again – also for the chosen variation, with a list of the most wanted products.'=>'“有货时通知我”：在缺货产品上，访客留下邮箱，再次有货时会收到一封邮件——也适用于所选变体，并提供最受期待产品列表。','Wholesale Prices'=>'批发价','Own prices for business customers – a wholesale price per product or a percent off the shop or a category, customer discounts and a form where customers apply for a wholesale account.'=>'为企业客户设置专属价格——按商品设置批发价，或对整个商店或某个分类打折，另有客户折扣，以及客户申请批发账户的表单。','Product Filters PRO & Filter Panel'=>'产品筛选 PRO 与筛选面板','The product filters without reloading the page, brand and "on sale" filters, swatches, buttons and dropdowns, and the Filter Panel: the filters in a drawer on phones with "Show N products".'=>'无需重新加载页面的产品筛选、品牌和“促销中”筛选、色板、按钮和下拉列表，以及筛选面板：在手机上把筛选放进抽屉，并带有“显示 N 个产品”。','Motion Effects'=>'动态效果','Scrolling and mouse effects for any block: vertical and horizontal parallax, transparency, blur, rotate and scale while scrolling, a block that follows the mouse and a 3D tilt.'=>'适用于任意区块的滚动和鼠标效果：垂直和水平视差、透明度、模糊、滚动时旋转和缩放、跟随鼠标的区块以及 3D 倾斜。','Display Conditions'=>'显示条件','Show or hide any block by rules: signed in or guest, user role, device, browser, date, days and time, URL parameter, the site the visitor came from, a cookie, new or returning visitor, the cart and the orders of the customer. Works on cached pages.'=>'按规则显示或隐藏任意区块：已登录或访客、用户角色、设备、浏览器、日期、星期和时间、URL 参数、访客来源网站、Cookie、新访客或回访者、购物车和顾客的订单。在缓存页面上也有效。','Content Slider'=>'内容滑块','A slider where every slide has its own background and can hold any blocks. Full-width backgrounds with centered content.'=>'每张幻灯片都有自己的背景并可包含任意区块的滑块。全宽背景，内容居中。','Content Tabs'=>'内容选项卡','Horizontal or vertical tabs; every tab holds any blocks.'=>'水平或垂直选项卡；每个选项卡可包含任意区块。','Content Switcher'=>'内容切换器','A switch between two or more versions of content, e.g. annual and lifetime pricing. Every option holds any blocks.'=>'在两个或多个内容版本之间切换，例如年付和终身定价。每个选项可包含任意区块。','Before / After'=>'前 / 后对比','Two images on top of each other with a slider between them, to compare before and after.'=>'两张叠放的图片，中间有滑块，用于对比前后效果。','Image with Background'=>'带背景的图片','A front image (ideally with a transparent background) over a background image or a decorative shape. The layers move slightly in space with the mouse.'=>'前景图片（最好是透明背景）放在背景图片或装饰形状上。图层会随鼠标在空间中轻微移动。','Classic · Ivory'=>'经典 · 象牙白','Product page'=>'产品页面','Classic · Sage'=>'经典 · 鼠尾草','Classic · Ocean'=>'经典 · 海洋','Shop page'=>'商店页面','Classic · Mono'=>'经典 · 单色','Sidebar · Ivory'=>'侧边栏 · 象牙白','Sidebar · Ocean'=>'侧边栏 · 海洋','Sidebar · Sage'=>'侧边栏 · 鼠尾草','Essential · Ivory'=>'基础 · 象牙白','Essential · Ocean'=>'基础 · 海洋','Essential · Sage'=>'基础 · 鼠尾草','Compact · Mono'=>'紧凑 · 单色','Compact · Coral'=>'紧凑 · 珊瑚','Compact · Violet'=>'紧凑 · 紫罗兰','Night · No