t updates'=>'无需更新的新模板','Templates Import loads new free templates from our library as soon as they are published.'=>'Templates Import 会在新的免费模板发布后立即从我们的模板库中加载。','Classic themes: templates and store layouts keep their width, and small block images stay small in Twenty Twenty-One.'=>'经典主题：模板和商店布局保持原有宽度，区块中的小图片在 Twenty Twenty-One 中也保持小尺寸。','Welcome'=>'欢迎','Blocks'=>'区块','Guides'=>'指南','Settings'=>'设置','Envo Blocks PRO'=>'Envo Blocks PRO','Get PRO'=>'获取 PRO','Sales'=>'销售','More'=>'更多','Block settings'=>'区块设置','Discount Rules'=>'折扣规则','Abandoned Carts'=>'弃置购物车','Loyalty Points'=>'积分','There are no settings yet.'=>'暂无设置。','Envo Blocks Settings'=>'Envo Blocks 设置','WooCommerce is needed'=>'需要 WooCommerce','WooCommerce is installed but not active'=>'WooCommerce 已安装但未启用','WooCommerce is not installed'=>'WooCommerce 未安装','Checkout Fields, Payment QR Code, Invoices, Store Layouts and the blocks marked WooCommerce need an active WooCommerce. They appear in the Envo Blocks menu and in the block inserter as soon as it is active. The templates, sections, presets and the other blocks work without it.'=>'Checkout Fields、Payment QR Code、发票、Store Layouts 以及标有 WooCommerce 的区块需要启用 WooCommerce。启用后，它们会立即出现在 Envo Blocks 菜单和区块插入器中。模板、区段、预设和其他区块无需它即可使用。','Activate WooCommerce'=>'启用 WooCommerce','Install and activate WooCommerce'=>'安装并启用 WooCommerce','Ask the administrator of the site to install and activate WooCommerce.'=>'请网站管理员安装并启用 WooCommerce。','About WooCommerce'=>'关于 WooCommerce','Envo Blocks:'=>'Envo Blocks：','Checkout Fields, Payment QR Code, Invoices, Store Layouts and the WooCommerce blocks need an active WooCommerce.'=>'Checkout Fields、Payment QR Code、发票、Store Layouts 和 WooCommerce 区块需要启用 WooCommerce。','Envo Blocks – Store Templates, Blocks & Layouts for WooCommerce'=>'Envo Blocks – 适用于 WooCommerce 的商店模板、区块和布局','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','Envo Blocks pages'=>'Envo Blocks 页面','Envo Blocks PRO blocks'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 区块','More WooCommerce and content blocks in Envo Blocks PRO:'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 中的更多 WooCommerce 和内容区块：','All PRO blocks with guides and demos'=>'所有 PRO 区块及指南和演示','%d more blocks for your store'=>'为您的商店再添 %d 个区块','Product carousels, mega menus, wishlist, compare, variation swatches, sticky cart and premium templates.'=>'产品轮播、超级菜单、心愿单、对比、变体样本、悬浮购物车和高级模板。','See what is in PRO'=>'查看 PRO 包含的内容','Build store pages in minutes'=>'几分钟内搭建商店页面','Import a ready-made page, drop in single sections or ready-made block presets, and add WooCommerce blocks that help you sell: trust badges, coupons, delivery estimates and more.'=>'导入现成的页面，放入单个区段或现成的区块预设，并添加帮助您销售的 WooCommerce 区块：信任徽章、优惠券、送达预估等。','Create a page'=>'创建页面','View live demos'=>'查看在线演示','Page sections'=>'页面区段','Get started in three steps'=>'三步开始','Open a page in the editor'=>'在编辑器中打开页面','Create a new page or edit an existing one.'=>'创建新页面或编辑现有页面。','Click "Templates Import" in the toolbar'=>'点击工具栏中的“Templates Import”','Choose Templates for a whole page, Sections for one part of a page or Presets for a ready-made block.'=>'整页选择“模板”，页面的一部分选择“区段”，现成区块选择“预设”。','Import and make it yours'=>'导入并打造成您自己的','Change texts, colors and images. Products and categories come from your own store.'=>'更改文本、颜色和图片。产品和分类来自您自己的商店。','How to import a template'=>'如何导入模板','Blocks in the Envo Blocks section of the inserter'=>'插入器中 Envo Blocks 分组下的区块','All blocks with guides and demos'=>'所有区块及指南和演示','Need help?'=>'需要帮助？','Support forum'=>'支持论坛','Do you like Envo Blocks?'=>'喜欢 Envo Blocks 吗？','A short review on WordPress.org helps other store owners find the plugin.'=>'在 WordPress.org 上留下简短评价可以帮助其他店主找到这个插件。','You cannot create posts or pages, or the block editor is turned off for them.'=>'您无法创建文章或页面，或者它们的区块编辑器已关闭。','Here you import whole templates into a new page or post. Page sections and presets are inserted right where you edit: open a page or post, click "Templates Import" in the toolbar and switch to Sections or Presets.'=>'在这里将完整模板导入新的页面或文章。页面区段和预设会插入到您正在编辑的位置：打开页面或文章，点击工具栏中的“Templates Import”，然后切换到“区段”或“预设”。','Open a new page'=>'打开新页面','Loading templates…'=>'正在加载模板…','The template library needs JavaScript.'=>'模板库需要 JavaScript。','Find them in the Envo Blocks section of the block inserter. Each block has a guide and a live demo with ready-made variants.'=>'可在区块插入器的 Envo Blocks 分组中找到它们。每个区块都有指南和带现成变体的在线演示。','Guide'=>'指南','Find them in the Envo Blocks PRO section of the block inserter.'=>'可在区块插入器的 Envo Blocks PRO 分组中找到它们。','Find them in the Envo Blocks PRO section of the block inserter. Without an active license they are shown on your pages but cannot be edited.'=>'可在区块插入器的 Envo Blocks PRO 分组中找到它们。没有有效许可证时，它们会显示在您的页面上，但无法编辑。','These blocks come with Envo Blocks PRO. Open a guide or a live demo to see what they do.'=>'这些区块随 Envo Blocks PRO 提供。打开指南或在线演示了解它们的功能。','Step-by-step guides with pictures. They open on envoblocks.com in a new tab.'=>'带图片的分步指南。它们会在新标签页中的 envoblocks.com 上打开。','PRO: %s'=>'PRO：%s','Install Envo Blocks PRO'=>'安装 Envo Blocks PRO','Activate the license key'=>'激活许可证密钥','Import a premium template'=>'导入高级模板','All PRO documentation'=>'全部 PRO 文档','Envo Blocks PRO is active'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 已启用','Thank you! All PRO blocks, premium templates and premium page sections are ready to use.'=>'谢谢！所有 PRO 区块、高级模板和高级页面区段均可使用。','PRO settings'=>'PRO 设置','PRO documentation'=>'PRO 文档','Everything for a complete store: %d more blocks and premium templates'=>'打造完整商店所需的一切：再添 %d 个区块和高级模板','Envo Blocks PRO adds product and category carousels, mega menus, AJAX search, wishlist, compare, variation swatches, sticky cart and more, plus premium templates and page sections from our demos.'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 增加了产品和分类轮播、超级菜单、AJAX 搜索、心愿单、对比、变体样本、悬浮购物车等，以及来自我们演示的高级模板和页面区段。','%d WooCommerce and content blocks'=>'%d 个 WooCommerce 和内容区块','Premium templates and page sections'=>'高级模板和页面区段','Live demos of every block and template'=>'每个区块和模板的在线演示','Updates and support'=>'更新和支持','Premium page sections'=>'高级页面区段','Insert them from the Sections tab of the template window. Click a picture to see it in its live 