og in (for visitors who are not signed in)'=>'登录（面向未登录的访客）','The settings were saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Show products without prices and without Add to cart – for everyone, or only for visitors who are not signed in (wholesale, B2B, "ask for a price"). A button of your choice takes the place of Add to cart.'=>'显示商品但不显示价格和“加入购物车” – 面向所有人，或仅面向未登录访客（批发、B2B、“价格面议”）。由您选择的按钮代替“加入购物车”。','Off'=>'关闭','For visitors who are not signed in'=>'面向未登录访客','For everyone'=>'面向所有人','Only these categories'=>'仅限这些分类','All products'=>'所有产品','Empty = all products. Subcategories count.'=>'留空 = 所有商品。包含子分类。','Hide the prices'=>'隐藏价格','Show the prices (only no Add to cart)'=>'显示价格（仅隐藏“加入购物车”）','Text instead of the price'=>'替代价格的文字','Empty: "Log in to see prices" for visitors who are not signed in, nothing for everyone.'=>'留空：对未登录访客显示“登录后查看价格”，对所有人不显示。','Button instead of Add to cart'=>'替代“加入购物车”的按钮','"Request a quote" with a quote list comes with Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'带询价清单的“询价”包含在 Envo Blocks PRO 中。','Link of the button'=>'按钮链接','For the link button, e.g. your contact page. Empty = the product page.'=>'用于链接按钮，例如您的联系页面。留空 = 商品页面。','Sorry, you are not allowed to change these settings.'=>'抱歉，您无权更改这些设置。','Company name'=>'公司名称','%s (optional)'=>'%s（可选）','Select an option…'=>'选择一个选项…','Checkout Fields'=>'Checkout Fields','Sorry, you are not allowed to change the checkout fields.'=>'抱歉，您无权更改结账字段。','Checkbox'=>'复选框','Address (billing and shipping)'=>'地址（账单和收货）','Order (additional information)'=>'订单（附加信息）','The checkout fields were saved.'=>'结账字段已保存。','The checkout fields are back to the settings of WooCommerce.'=>'结账字段已恢复为 WooCommerce 的设置。','Address fields'=>'地址字段','The billing and shipping address of the checkout (block checkout and classic checkout). Drag the rows to change the order. Some countries have their own rules (for example no postcode or state); a field you hide or make optional stays so in every country.'=>'结账中的账单和收货地址（区块结账和经典结账）。拖动行可更改顺序。某些国家/地区有自己的规则（例如没有邮编或省/州）；您隐藏或设为可选的字段在所有国家/地区都保持这样。','Field'=>'字段','Required'=>'必填','Drag to change the order'=>'拖动以更改顺序','Label of %s'=>'%s 的标签','Show %s'=>'显示 %s','Needed for shipping and taxes'=>'配送和税费所需','%s is required'=>'%s 为必填项','Additional fields'=>'附加字段','Own fields of the checkout. The answers are saved with the order and shown in the order screen, in the order e-mails and in My account. Contact fields are shown under the e-mail address, address fields in both addresses, order fields under "Additional information".'=>'结账的自定义字段。答案随订单保存，并显示在订单页面、订单邮件和我的账户中。联系字段显示在电子邮件地址下方，地址字段显示在两个地址中，订单字段显示在“附加信息”下方。','Type'=>'类型','Options (select)'=>'选项（下拉选择）','No additional fields yet.'=>'还没有附加字段。','Add field'=>'添加字段','Go back to the checkout fields of WooCommerce? Your changes and additional fields are removed (answers already saved with orders stay).'=>'恢复为 WooCommerce 的结账字段？您的更改和附加字段将被删除（已随订单保存的答案会保留）。','Reset to WooCommerce'=>'重置为 WooCommerce','e.g. VAT number'=>'例如 增值税号','One option per line'=>'每行一个选项','Options, one per line'=>'选项，每行一个','Default template'=>'默认模板','The file could not be uploaded. It may be larger than your server allows.'=>'无法上传文件。文件可能超过了服务器允许的大小。','Imported page'=>'导入的页面','The uploaded file is no longer available. Please upload it again.'=>'上传的文件已不可用。请重新上传。','Template file is too large.'=>'模板文件太大。','Your server cannot open ZIP files (the PHP zip extension is missing). Upload the JSON file instead.'=>'您的服务器无法打开 ZIP 文件（缺少 PHP zip 扩展）。请改为上传 JSON 文件。','The ZIP file could not be opened.'=>'无法打开 ZIP 文件。','The ZIP file does not contain a template (template.json).'=>'ZIP 文件不包含模板（template.json）。','Your server cannot create ZIP files (the PHP zip extension is missing). Use Export as JSON instead.'=>'您的服务器无法创建 ZIP 文件（缺少 PHP zip 扩展）。请改用“导出为 JSON”。','The ZIP file could not be created.'=>'无法创建 ZIP 文件。','This filter needs Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'此筛选器需要 Envo Blocks PRO。','Availability'=>'库存状态','Offers'=>'优惠','Create a product attribute first (Products › Attributes).'=>'请先创建产品属性（产品 › 属性）。','Any'=>'任意','Show less'=>'收起','Show more'=>'显示更多','Rated %d star'=>'评分 %d 星','Highest price'=>'最高价格','up to %s'=>'最高 %s','from %s'=>'%s 起','%s stars'=>'%s 星','Blue'=>'蓝色','Remove filter: %s'=>'移除筛选：%s','Form #%d'=>'表单 #%d','This plugin is not used by any template.'=>'没有模板使用此插件。','The plugin was downloaded but could not be found.'=>'插件已下载但找不到。','This theme is not recommended by any template.'=>'没有模板推荐此主题。','This theme cannot be activated on this site.'=>'无法在此网站上启用此主题。','WordPress cannot install files on this server without FTP details. Please install it in Plugins > Add New (or Appearance > Themes).'=>'没有 FTP 信息，WordPress 无法在此服务器上安装文件。请在 插件 > 添加新插件（或 外观 > 主题）中安装。','The installation failed.'=>'安装失败。','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'您无权执行此操作。','Every single product page.'=>'每个单个产品页面。','The shop, product categories, tags, brands and product search.'=>'商店、产品分类、标签、品牌和产品搜索。','The cart page, also when the cart is empty.'=>'购物车页面，包括购物车为空时。','The thank-you page after an order.'=>'下单后的感谢页面。','My account with all its sections, and the login form.'=>'我的账户的所有部分以及登录表单。','The checkout page (not the order received and order payment pages). The WooCommerce checkout itself stays: payments, shipping and coupons work as before.'=>'结账页面（不包括订单已收到页面和订单支付页面）。WooCommerce 结账本身保持不变：支付、配送和优惠券照常工作。','The cart panel that slides in from the side of every page (Mini-Cart, Sticky Cart, after Add to cart).'=>'在每个页面从侧边滑入的购物车面板（Mini-Cart、Sticky Cart、加入购物车后）。','Store Layout'=>'商店布局','Add Layout'=>'添加布局','Add Store Layout'=>'添加商店布局','Edit Store Layout'=>'编辑商店布局','New Store Layout'=>'新建商店布局','Search Store Layouts'=>'搜索商店布局','No store layouts yet.'=>'还没有商店布局。','No store layouts in the trash.'=>'回收站中没有商店布局。','Layout published: it is used on the store pages now.'=>'布局已发布：现在已用于商店页面。','Layout updated.'=>'布局已更新。','There is no store page to show this layout on yet (for example no product or no order).'=>'还没有可显示此布局的商店页面（例如没有产品或订单）。','This layout is included in Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'此布局包含在 Envo Blocks PRO 中。','PRO layouts are not available. Make sure the PRO plugin is active and its license is active.'=>'PRO 布局不可用。请确认 PRO 插件已启用且其许可证有效。','Template file was not found.'=>'未找到模板文件。','The layout file is not valid.'=>'布局文件无效。','Layout not found.'=>'未找到布局。','Store layouts need WooCommerce.'=>'商店布局需要 WooCommerce。','Store layouts change the product page, the shop, the cart, the order received page and My account in any theme: the theme header and footer stay, the part between them comes from the layout. Start from a ready-made design below or with an empty layout, edit it with blocks and publish it. A published layout is used at once; a draft is not.'=>'商店布局可在任何主题中更改产品页面、商店、购物车、订单已收到页面和我的账户：主题的页眉和页脚保持不变，中间部分来自布局。从下方的现成设计或空白布局开始，用区块编辑并发布。已发布的布局会立即使用；草稿则不会。','Read the guide'=>'阅读指南','Your store layouts'=>'您的商店布局','All layouts are turned off: the store shows the theme pages.'=>'所有布局已关闭：商店显示主题页面。','Turn layouts on'=>'开启布局','The store shows the theme pages until you turn them on again. Nothing is deleted.'=>'在您重新开启之前，商店显示主题页面。不会删除任何内容。','Turn all layouts off'=>'关闭所有布局','Page'=>'页面','Shown on'=>'显示于','The theme page (no layout).'=>'主题页面（无布局）。','Empty layout'=>'空白布局','(no title)'=>'（无标题）','Draft – not used'=>'草稿 – 未使用','Published – all layouts are off'=>'已发布 – 所有布局已关闭','Not used: its rules need Envo Blocks PRO'=>'未使用：其规则需要 Envo Blocks PRO','Not used: "%s" comes first'=>'未使用：“%s”优先','Stop using'=>'停止使用','Use it'=>'使用','Trash'=>'回收站','Loading layouts…'=>'正在加载布局…','Theme template in the Site Editor'=>'站点编辑器中的主题模板','Every %s'=>'每个%s','The shop, all categories and product searches'=>'商店、所有分类和产品搜索','Every page except the cart and the checkout'=>'除购物车和结账外的所有页面','The layout is used on the store pages now.'=>'布局现在已用于商店页面。','The layout is a draft now and not used.'=>'布局现为草稿，未使用。','All layouts are turned off.'=>'所有布局已关闭。','Layouts are turned on.'=>'布局已开启。','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'抱歉，您无权执行此操作。','Layout settings'=>'布局设置','Choose…'=>'选择…','Published = used on these pages, draft = not used. The theme header and footer stay.'=>'已发布 = 用于这些页面，草稿 = 未使用。主题的页眉和页脚保持不变。','All pages of this kind.'=>'此类型的所有页面。','With Envo Blocks PRO a layout can be shown only for some categories, tags or products.'=>'使用 Envo Blocks PRO 时，布局可以只对某些分类、标签或产品显示。','Distraction-free checkout'=>'无干扰结账','Without the header and the footer of the theme (no menu): add the Checkout Header block for the logo, a secure checkout note and a link back to the cart.'=>'不显示主题的页眉和页脚（无菜单）：添加结账页眉区块以显示标志、安全结账提示和返回购物车链接。','Product of the preview'=>'预览的产品','Automatic'=>'自动','The editor and the preview show this product. Save and reload the editor after a change.'=>'编辑器和预览显示此产品。更改后请保存并重新加载编辑器。','Accent (buttons, highlights)'=>'强调色（按钮、高亮）','Text on the accent'=>'强调色上的文本','Page background'=>'页面背景','Boxes and cards'=>'框和卡片','Secondary text'=>'次要文本','Ivory'=>'象牙白','Sage'=>'鼠尾草','Ocean'=>'海洋','Coral'=>'珊瑚','Violet'=>'紫罗兰','Sand'=>'沙色','Blush'=>'腮红粉','Sun'=>'阳光','Mono'=>'单色','Noir (dark)'=>'黑（深色）','Midnight (dark)'=>'午夜（深色）','Forest (dark)'=>'森林（深色）','Colours'=>'颜色','This layout uses no palette of the designs: change its colours in the blocks.'=>'此布局未使用设计的调色板：请在区块中更改其颜色。','Own colours'=>'自定义颜色','Save the layout to recolour it: the sections, the buttons, prices and fields of WooCommerce. A changed colour picks "Own colours".'=>'保存布局以重新着色：区段、按钮、价格和 WooCommerce 的字段。更改颜色后会选中“自定义颜色”。','PRO templates are not available. Make sure the PRO plugin is active and its license is active.'=>'PRO 模板不可用。请确认 PRO 插件已启用且其许可证有效。','Store layouts are used from Envo Blocks › Store Layouts.'=>'商店布局在 Envo Blocks › Store Layouts 中使用。','Template file is not valid JSON.'=>'模板文件不是有效的 JSON。','Template file has an unsupported format.'=>'模板文件格式不受支持。','Template structure is invalid.'=>'模板结构无效。','Template contains too many blocks.'=>'模板包含的区块过多。','Template contains an invalid block.'=>'模板包含无效的区块。','Template uses a block that is not available on this site.'=>'模板使用了此网站上不可用的区块。','Template contains invalid block attributes.'=>'模板包含无效的区块属性。','Template contains an invalid number.'=>'模板包含无效的数字。','Template contains a value that is too long.'=>'模板包含过长的值。','Template contains an unsafe URL.'=>'模板包含不安全的 URL。','Template structure is too complex.'=>'模板结构过于复杂。','Template contains an invalid attribute name.'=>'模板包含无效的属性名称。','Template contains an unsupported value.'=>'模板包含不受支持的值。','What’s new in Envo Blocks %s'=>'Envo Blocks %s 的新功能','Fixed:'=>'已修复：','See the blocks'=>'查看区块','Full changelog'=>'完整更新日志','%d new store template'=>'%d 个新的商店模板','complete stores you can import in Templates Import.'=>'可在 Templates Import 中导入的完整商店。','+%d more'=>'还有 %d 个','See the new templates'=>'查看新模板','Direct bank transfer is not enabled: the QR code shows only for orders paid this way.'=>'直接银行转账未启用：二维码仅对以此方式支付的订单显示。','Payment settings'=>'支付设置','A QR code for the banking app of the customer, for orders paid by direct bank transfer that wait for the payment: QR Platba (SPD) for CZK and EPC QR (SEPA, "GiroCode") for EUR. The customer scans it and gets the account, amount and reference filled in. Add the Payment QR Code block to the Order Confirmation template; the customer e-mails get the code too. It does not confirm payments.'=>'为等待付款的直接银行转账订单提供顾客银行应用使用的二维码：CZK 使用 QR Platba（SPD），EUR 使用 EPC QR（SEPA，“GiroCode”）。顾客扫描后，账户、金额和参考号会自动填写。请将 Payment QR Code 区块添加到订单确认模板；顾客邮件中也会包含此码。它不会确认付款。','QR code in e-mails'=>'邮件中的二维码','Add the code to the customer e-mails of orders waiting for the bank transfer'=>'在等待银行转账的订单的顾客邮件中添加此码','The first account with an IBAN'=>'第一个带 IBAN 的账户','The accounts with a valid IBAN from the Direct bank transfer settings of WooCommerce.'=>'WooCommerce 直接银行转账设置中带有效 IBAN 的账户。','No account with a valid IBAN yet: add the IBAN (and BIC) of your account to the Direct bank transfer settings of WooCommerce.'=>'还没有带有效 IBAN 的账户：请在 WooCommerce 的直接银行转账设置中添加账户的 IBAN（和 BIC）。','Bank accounts'=>'银行账户','Placeholders: {order_number}, {order_id}, {site_title}. The digits of the order number are also the variable symbol (QR Platba).'=>'占位符：{order_number}、{order_id}、{site_title}。订单号的数字也是可变符号（QR Platba）。','Sample'=>'示例','The code of a sample order with these settings. Try it with your banking app, without sending the payment.'=>'使用这些设置生成的示例订单二维码。可用您的银行应用试扫，无需发送付款。','Pay by bank transfer'=>'银行转账支付','Scan the code with the app of your bank: the payment details are filled in.'=>'用您银行的应用扫描此码：付款详情会自动填写。','Account name'=>'账户名','IBAN'=>'IBAN','BIC / SWIFT'=>'BIC / SWIFT','Amount'=>'金额','Variable symbol'=>'可变符号','Message'=>'附言','Envo Blocks preview: %s'=>'Envo Blocks 预览：%s','Lowest price before a discount'=>'折扣前最低价格','The lowest price of the days before a discount (EU Omnibus rule) is set in %s.'=>'折扣前几天的最低价格（欧盟 Omnibus 规定）在 %s 中设置。','Envo Blocks › Lowest Price'=>'Envo Blocks › 最低价格','In the EU a discount must show the lowest price of the 30 days before it (Omnibus directive). Envo Blocks keeps the price changes of your products and variations and shows that price with the Lowest Price block, or under the price of every product when you turn it on here.'=>'在欧盟，折扣必须显示折扣前 30 天内的最低价格（Omnibus 指令）。Envo Blocks 会保存您的产品和变体的价格变化，并通过最低价格区块显示该价格；如果您在此处开启，则会显示在每个产品价格下方。','Number of days'=>'天数','Show under the price'=>'在价格下方显示','No – only where I add the Lowest Price block'=>'否——仅在我添加最低价格区块的位置','On the product page and in product lists'=>'在产品页面和产品列表中','Works with block and classic themes. Do not add the Lowest Price block to the same place too.'=>'适用于区块主题和经典主题。不要在同一位置再添加最低价格区块。','{days} is the number of days, {price} the lowest price. Leave empty for the default text.'=>'{days} 为天数，{price} 为最低价格。留空则使用默认文本。','Price history'=>'价格历史','A change is saved whenever a product is saved (editing, bulk edit, import, scheduled sales); a daily check catches the rest. Until the history reaches back far enough, a discount shows the regular price as the lowest price.'=>'每次保存产品时都会记录变化（编辑、批量编辑、导入、定时促销）；每日检查会补全其余部分。在历史记录足够长之前，折扣会把常规价格显示为最低价格。','Products and variations with a history'=>'有历史记录的产品和变体','History since'=>'历史记录起始','Not started yet – the first check runs within minutes.'=>'尚未开始——首次检查将在几分钟内运行。','Add the Lowest Price block to the product template, or see the %s.'=>'将最低价格区块添加到产品模板，或查看%s。','guide'=>'指南','Part of Envo Blocks PRO.'=>'属于 Envo Blocks PRO。','Review requests and rewards'=>'评价请求和奖励','Get more reviews – and more photos – without asking by hand.'=>'无需手动邀请，就能获得更多评价 – 和更多照片。','Some days after an order is completed the customer gets an e-mail with the bought products and "Write a review" buttons.'=>'订单完成几天后，顾客会收到一封邮件，附有所购商品和“写评价”按钮。','When you approve a review of a bought product, the customer gets a one-time coupon as a thank-you – if you like, only for reviews with a photo.'=>'当您批准已购商品的评价时，顾客会收到一张一次性优惠券作为感谢 – 如需，可仅限带照片的评价。','Both are WooCommerce e-mails in the design of your store, with their own texts.'=>'两者都是采用您商店设计的 WooCommerce 邮件，并有各自的文字。','Review request'=>'评价请求','Send'=>'发送','days after the order is completed'=>'天后（订单完成后）','Review reward'=>'评价奖励','% coupon'=>'% 优惠券','Only reviews with a photo'=>'仅限带照片的评价','Price alerts and price history chart'=>'降价提醒和价格历史图表','The price history kept for the lowest price can bring shoppers back.'=>'为最低价保存的价格历史可以把顾客带回来。','Price Alert block: visitors leave their e-mail on a product and get one e-mail when its price drops.'=>'降价提醒区块：访客在商品上留下邮箱，降价时收到一封邮件。','Price History Chart block: how the price of a product changed, from the same history.'=>'价格历史图表区块：基于同一历史，显示商品价格的变化。','An overview of waiting alerts and the most watched products on this page.'=>'本页概览等待中的提醒和最受关注的商品。','Minimum price drop'=>'最低降幅','An alert goes out only when the price falls at least this much below the price at the sign-up.'=>'仅当价格比订阅时的价格至少低这么多时才会发送提醒。','Quote page'=>'询价页面','— Choose a page —'=>'— 选择页面 —','With Envo Blocks PRO the button can be "Request a quote": customers collect products in a quote list and send it from this page.'=>'使用 Envo Blocks PRO，按钮可以是“询价”：顾客把商品加入询价清单，并从此页面发送。','Request a quote and wholesale prices'=>'询价和批发价','Sell to businesses and on demand: let customers ask for a price instead of buying.'=>'面向企业和定制销售：让顾客询价而不是直接购买。','A "Request a quote" button instead of Add to cart on catalog products, and a quote list.'=>'目录商品用“询价”按钮代替“加入购物车”，并提供询价清单。','Each request is an order with the status "Quote requested": set the prices and send the customer a link to pay.'=>'每个询价都是状态为“已询价”的订单：设置价格并向顾客发送付款链接。','E-mails for you and the customer, in WooCommerce › Settings › Emails.'=>'给您和顾客的邮件，在“WooCommerce › 设置 › 电子邮件”中。','Wholesale prices: own prices for approved business customers, a discount by category and a minimum order.'=>'批发价：为已批准的企业客户设置专属价格、按分类折扣和最低订单。','Checkout in steps and checkout designs'=>'分步结账和结账设计','Make a long checkout feel short.'=>'让冗长的结账显得简短。','Checkout in steps: contact, shipping and payment one after another, with a progress bar.'=>'分步结账：联系信息、配送和付款依次进行，并带进度条。','More checkout designs in Store Layouts – distraction-free, split, with trust badges or products to add – with your checkout fields inside.'=>'商店布局中有更多结账设计 – 无干扰、分栏、带信任徽章或可添加的商品 – 并保留您设置的结账字段。','Checkout in steps'=>'分步结账','Show the checkout in steps'=>'分步显示结账','Contact, shipping and payment one after another, with a progress bar. Turned on in the block settings of Envo Blocks PRO; the fields set here stay in the steps.'=>'联系信息、配送和付款依次进行，并带进度条。在 Envo Blocks PRO 的区块设置中开启；此处设置的字段会保留在各步骤中。','Checkout steps settings'=>'结账步骤设置','Activate license'=>'激活许可证','Envo Blocks PRO is installed. Activate your license key to use this block.'=>'Envo Blocks PRO 已安装。请激活许可证密钥以使用此区块。','Renew license'=>'续订许可证','Your Envo Blocks PRO license has expired. Renew it to use this block.'=>'您的 Envo Blocks PRO 许可证已过期。请续订以使用此区块。','Product feeds'=>'商品数据源','Hide from the product feed (Google Merchant Center, Meta catalog)'=>'从商品数据源中隐藏（Google Merchant Center、Meta 目录）','Product Feed'=>'商品数据源','no price'=>'无价格','no image'=>'无图片','hidden or with a password'=>'已隐藏或有密码','prices hidden by the catalog mode'=>'价格被目录模式隐藏','out of stock'=>'缺货','marked "Hide from the product feed"'=>'已勾选“从商品数据源中隐藏”','The feed was built.'=>'数据源已生成。','Product feed'=>'商品数据源','Your products as one XML feed for Google Merchant Center (Google Shopping and the free product listings in Google) and for the Meta catalog (Facebook and Instagram shops). Add the feed URL there once; the feed updates itself every hour when products change.'=>'将您的商品生成一个 XML 数据源，用于 Google Merchant Center（Google 购物及 Google 免费商品展示）和 Meta 目录（Facebook 和 Instagram 商店）。只需在那里添加一次数据源 URL；商品变化时，数据源每小时自动更新。','Feed URL'=>'数据源 URL','%1$s products in the feed, built %2$s.'=>'数据源中有 %1$s 个商品，生成于 %2$s。','Left out: %s.'=>'未包含：%s。','Build the feed now'=>'立即生成数据源','Open the feed'=>'打开数据源','Products › Add products › Add products from a file › Enter a link to your file'=>'Products › Add products › Add products from a file › Enter a link to your file','Catalog › Data sources › Add items › Data feed › Scheduled feed'=>'Catalog › Data sources › Add items › Data feed › Scheduled feed','The feed is off. Turn it on below to get its URL.'=>'数据源已关闭。在下方开启即可获取 URL。','Make the product feed'=>'生成商品数据源','All categories'=>'所有分类','Empty = all products. A single product is left out with "Hide from the product feed" in Product data › Advanced.'=>'留空 = 所有商品。单个商品可在“商品数据 › 高级”中勾选“从商品数据源中隐藏”排除。','Every variation as its own product (recommended by Google)'=>'每个变体作为独立商品（Google 推荐）','Also products that are out of stock (shown as out of stock)'=>'也包含缺货商品（显示为缺货）','Brands of WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce 品牌','Attribute: %s'=>'属性：%s','Always the text below'=>'始终使用下方文字','The text is used when a product has no brand. Your own products: your shop name.'=>'商品没有品牌时使用此文字。自有商品：您的商店名称。','Attributes'=>'属性','Google asks for the color and the size of clothing and shoes.'=>'Google 要求提供服装和鞋类的颜色和尺码。','product condition' . "\4" . 'Condition'=>'商品状况','New'=>'新','Refurbished'=>'翻新','Used'=>'二手','Google product category'=>'Google 商品类别','Optional: the number or the path of the Google category of most of your products (e.g. 267 = Mobile Phones). Google finds it by itself when empty.'=>'可选：您大部分商品的 Google 类别编号或路径（例如 267 = 手机）。留空时 Google 会自行判断。','The feed also takes the GTIN, UPC, EAN or ISBN field of WooCommerce (Product data › Inventory) and the SKU as the MPN.'=>'数据源还会读取 WooCommerce 的 GTIN、UPC、EAN 或 ISBN 字段（商品数据 › 库存），并将 SKU 用作 MPN。','Product questions'=>'商品问答','Questions (%d)'=>'问题（%d）','Search the questions'=>'搜索问题','Search the questions…'=>'搜索问题…','No question matches. Ask it below.'=>'没有匹配的问题。请在下方提问。','Asked by %1$s on %2$s'=>'%1$s 于 %2$s 提问','a customer'=>'一位顾客','Answered by %s'=>'来自 %s 的回答','Show more questions'=>'显示更多问题','No questions yet. Be the first to ask.'=>'还没有问题。来提第一个问题吧。','Thank you! Your question was sent. The answer will show here – and in your e-mail if you asked for it.'=>'谢谢！您的问题已发送。回答将显示在这里 – 如果您选择了，也会发送到您的邮箱。','Please fill in your name, a valid e-mail and the question.'=>'请填写姓名、有效的邮箱和问题。','Too many questions. Please try again later.'=>'提问过多。请稍后再试。','Your question could not be sent. Please try again.'=>'无法发送您的问题。请重试。','Log in to ask a question'=>'登录后提问','Ask a question'=>'提问','Your question'=>'您的问题','E-mail'=>'邮箱','You ask as %s.'=>'您将以 %s 的身份提问。','E-mail me the answer'=>'通过邮件把回答发给我','Your name shows with the answered question; your e-mail is only used to send you the answer.'=>'您的姓名会与已回答的问题一起显示；邮箱仅用于发送回答。','Send question'=>'发送问题','New question about %s'=>'关于 %s 的新问题','Answer it in Envo Blocks › Settings › Product Questions'=>'请在“Envo Blocks › 设置 › 商品问答”中回答','New product question'=>'新的商品问题','Waiting for an answer'=>'等待回答','Answered'=>'已回答','Hidden'=>'隐藏','The answer is published.'=>'回答已发布。','The answer is published and e-mailed to the customer.'=>'回答已发布并通过邮件发送给顾客。','The question is hidden.'=>'问题已隐藏。','The question is in the trash.'=>'问题已移至回收站。','Customers ask about a product on the product page; a question shows there once you answer it. Publishing an answer e-mails it to the customer when they asked for it.'=>'顾客在商品页面就商品提问；您回答后问题会显示在该页面。发布的回答会通过邮件发送给提出要求的顾客。','No questions here.'=>'这里没有问题。','wants the answer by e-mail'=>'希望通过邮件收到回答','Answer'=>'回答','Your answer…'=>'您的回答…','Update answer'=>'更新回答','Publish answer'=>'发布回答','Delete'=>'删除','Add a "Questions" tab to the product page'=>'在商品页面添加“问答”标签页','A tab next to Description and Reviews, in every theme. Or place the Product Questions block yourself, e.g. in the product template.'=>'在所有主题中，于描述和评价旁添加标签页。或自行放置商品问答区块，例如放在商品模板中。','Who can ask'=>'谁可以提问','Also visitors who are not signed in (with name and e-mail)'=>'未登录的访客也可以（填写姓名和邮箱）','New questions'=>'新问题','E-mail me every new question'=>'每个新问题都发邮件给我','The question does not exist.'=>'问题不存在。','Your question about %s was answered'=>'您关于 %s 的问题已有回答','Hi %s,'=>'%s，您好：','thank you for your question about %s.'=>'感谢您关于 %s 的提问。','See the product and the other questions'=>'查看商品和其他问题','Your question was answered'=>'您的问题已有回答','Tabs of this product only, e.g. care instructions, ingredients or a warranty. They show after the Reviews tab of WooCommerce, or where the "The product\'s own tabs" tab of the Product Tabs block is. Shortcodes work in the text.'=>'仅此产品的选项卡，例如保养说明、成分或保修。它们显示在 WooCommerce 的评价选项卡之后，或 Product Tabs 区块中“产品自身的选项卡”所在的位置。文本中可以使用简码。','Remove tab'=>'移除选项卡','Video of %1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s 的视频（%2$d）','Videos'=>'视频','Videos in the product gallery: a YouTube, Vimeo or Dailymotion link, or a video file (mp4, webm) from the Media Library. The player loads only when the visitor clicks play. A video file also plays (muted) over the product image in product lists while the pointer is on it.'=>'产品图库中的视频：YouTube、Vimeo 或 Dailymotion 链接，或媒体库中的视频文件（mp4、webm）。仅当访客点击播放时才加载播放器。在产品列表中，鼠标指针停在产品图片上时，视频文件也会在图片上（静音）播放。','Add video'=>'添加视频','Video link or file'=>'视频链接或文件','Choose file'=>'选择文件','Cover image'=>'封面图片','Without an image the main product image is used.'=>'没有图片时使用产品主图。','Place in the gallery'=>'在图库中的位置','First (before the main image)'=>'最前（主图之前）','After the main image'=>'主图之后','Last'=>'最后','Remove video'=>'移除视频','Choose a video file'=>'选择视频文件','Choose a cover image'=>'选择封面图片','Unknown template file.'=>'未知的模板文件。','This design is loaded from our template library, which could not be reached from your server. Please try again later.'=>'此设计从我们的模板库加载，但您的服务器无法连接到模板库。请稍后再试。','The downloaded design is damaged. Please try again.'=>'下载的设计已损坏。请重试。','The block was not found.'=>'未找到区块。','An active PRO license is required to insert this block.'=>'需要有效的 PRO 许可证才能插入此区块。','The page is too large for a preview.'=>'页面太大，无法预览。','Template was not found.'=>'未找到模板。','An active PRO license is required to import this template.'=>'需要有效的 PRO 许可证才能导入此模板。','This page of the template was not found.'=>'未找到模板的此页面。','Photos in reviews'=>'评价中的照片','Customers add photos to their product review. The photos are saved as small WebP files without the camera data, show under the review once you approve it and in the Customer Photos block.'=>'顾客可在商品评价中添加照片。照片保存为不含相机数据的小型 WebP 文件，经您批准后显示在评价下方和“顾客照片”区块中。','Customers can add photos to their review'=>'顾客可在评价中添加照片','Photos per review'=>'每条评价的照片数','Largest photo (MB)'=>'最大照片（MB）','JPG, PNG or WebP. The server allows up to %d MB.'=>'JPG、PNG 或 WebP。服务器最多允许 %d MB。','Approve reviews in Products › Reviews'=>'在“商品 › 评价”中批准评价','Review settings of WooCommerce (ratings, verified owners)'=>'WooCommerce 评价设置（评分、已验证购买者）','Add photos (optional)'=>'添加照片（可选）','Choose photos'=>'选择照片','Up to %1$d photo, JPG, PNG or WebP, up to %2$d MB.'=>'最多 %1$d 张，JPG、PNG 或 WebP，每张不超过 %2$d MB。','Review photo – %s'=>'评价照片 – %s','Customer photo of %s'=>'%s 的顾客照片','Customer photo %d'=>'顾客照片 %d','Previous photo'=>'上一张照片','Next photo'=>'下一张照片','Only the first %d photos are added.'=>'只添加前 %d 张照片。','A photo is larger than %d MB and is left out.'=>'有一张照片超过 %d MB，已略过。','pick a template and your brand color, and we set up the pages, the front page and the colors of your store.'=>'选择一个模板和您的品牌颜色，我们会为您设置商店的页面、首页和颜色。','Start the wizard'=>'启动向导','Remove %s from the cart'=>'从购物车中移除 %s','Decrease the quantity of %s'=>'减少 %s 的数量','Increase the quantity of %s'=>'增加 %s 的数量','Quantity of %s'=>'%s 的数量','%s was removed from the cart.'=>'已将 %s 从购物车中移除。','The cart could not be updated. Please try again.'=>'无法更新购物车。请重试。','Close the cart'=>'关闭购物车','Panel'=>'面板','Slides in from the right'=>'从右侧滑入','Slides in from the left'=>'从左侧滑入','Open after Add to cart'=>'加入购物车后打开','Cart icons and cart links open it'=>'购物车图标和购物车链接可打开它','The WooCommerce Mini-Cart, the cart links of the theme and the Sticky Cart of Envo Blocks PRO open this panel. Not shown on the cart and the checkout.'=>'WooCommerce 的 Mini-Cart、主题的购物车链接和 Envo Blocks PRO 的 Sticky Cart 会打开此面板。在购物车和结账页面不显示。','Colour: Black'=>'颜色：黑色','Tax'=>'税务','Incl. %s'=>'含%s','Excl. %s'=>'不含%s','Tax Switcher'=>'含税切换','Including tax'=>'含税','Excluding tax'=>'不含税','Prices with or without tax'=>'含税或不含税价格','Let visitors choose whether the prices of the store are shown with or without tax (VAT) – handy when you sell to businesses and to consumers. Put the Tax Switcher block into the header or above the products; the choice is remembered and every price follows: product lists, the product page, the mini cart, the cart and the checkout.'=>'让访客选择商店价格以含税还是不含税（增值税）显示——同时面向企业和消费者销售时很方便。将“含税切换”区块放在页眉或商品上方；系统会记住选择，所有价格都会随之变化：商品列表、商品页面、迷你购物车、购物车和结账。','Taxes in WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce 中的税费','On – WooCommerce calculates taxes.'=>'开启 – WooCommerce 正在计算税费。','Off – turn on "Enable tax rates and calculations" in WooCommerce › Settings › General.'=>'关闭 – 请在“WooCommerce › 设置 › 常规”中开启“启用税率和计算”。','Tax rates'=>'税率','%d tax rate'=>'%d 个税率','No tax rates yet – add them in WooCommerce › Settings › Tax.'=>'尚无税率 – 请在“WooCommerce › 设置 › 税”中添加。','Tax settings'=>'税费设置','Default for visitors'=>'访客默认值','Shop: %1$s, cart and checkout: %2$s'=>'商店：%1$s，购物车和结账：%2$s','Visitors who have not chosen yet see the prices as set in WooCommerce › Settings › Tax ("Display prices in the shop").'=>'尚未选择的访客会按照“WooCommerce › 设置 › 税”（“在商店显示价格”）中的设置看到价格。','Until taxes are on and at least one tax rate exists, the Tax Switcher block shows nothing in the store.'=>'在启用税费且至少有一个税率之前，“含税切换”区块不会在商店中显示任何内容。','Switching'=>'切换','Visitors can switch between prices with and without tax'=>'访客可以在含税和不含税价格之间切换','Off: the Tax Switcher blocks show nothing and every visitor sees the prices as set in WooCommerce.'=>'关闭：“含税切换”区块不显示任何内容，每位访客都按 WooCommerce 的设置看到价格。','Cart and checkout'=>'购物车和结账','As chosen by the visitor'=>'按访客的选择','As set in WooCommerce (only the shop prices switch)'=>'按 WooCommerce 的设置（仅商店价格切换）','Text after the prices'=>'价格后的文字','By the choice: "incl. VAT" or "ex. VAT"'=>'按选择：“含增值税”或“不含增值税”','The price display suffix of WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce 的价格后缀','No text'=>'无文字','A fixed suffix of WooCommerce like "incl. VAT" would be wrong after a switch, so by default it is replaced with the text of the chosen mode.'=>'像“含增值税”这样的 WooCommerce 固定后缀在切换后会不正确，因此默认会替换为所选显示方式的文字。','Text with tax'=>'含税文字','Text without tax'=>'不含税文字','Good to know'=>'须知','Add the switch with the Tax Switcher block (Envo Blocks section of the inserter), e.g. in the header template part; in classic themes and widgets use the shortcode [envo_tax_switcher].'=>'使用“含税切换”区块（插入器的 Envo Blocks 部分）添加切换，例如放在页眉模板组件中；在经典主题和小工具中使用简码 [envo_tax_switcher]。','The choice is kept in a cookie (envo_tax_display) for a year. The amounts charged never change – only how the prices are shown.'=>'选择会在 Cookie（envo_tax_display）中保存一年。收取的金额永远不变——改变的只是价格的显示方式。','Orders, e-mails and the admin always use the settings of WooCommerce.'=>'订单、电子邮件和后台始终使用 WooCommerce 的设置。','Page cache: WP Super Cache, WP Rocket and LiteSpeed Cache keep a copy per choice by themselves. With another cache plugin or a CDN, add the cookie envo_tax_display to its "do not cache" or "vary by cookie" list; otherwise the block reloads a page that came from the cache with the other prices once.'=>'页面缓存：WP Super Cache、WP Rocket 和 LiteSpeed Cache 会自动为每种选择保留一份副本。使用其他缓存插件或 CDN 时，请将 Cookie envo_tax_display 添加到其“不缓存”或“按 Cookie 区分”列表中；否则区块会将来自缓存、显示另一种价格的页面重新加载一次。','Add to cart'=>'加入购物车','Remove %s from the wishlist'=>'从心愿单中移除 %s','Wishlist page'=>'心愿单页面','Page with the %s block. A published page with the block becomes the wishlist page when none is set.'=>'包含 %s 区块的页面。未设置心愿单页面时，包含此区块的已发布页面将成为心愿单页面。','Wishlist Page'=>'心愿单页面','Add %s to the wishlist'=>'将 %s 加入心愿单','Added to your wishlist'=>'已加入您的心愿单','Removed from your wishlist'=>'已从您的心愿单中移除','Added to the cart'=>'已加入购物车','In the cart'=>'已在购物车中','%d product'=>'%d 个产品','Invoices'=>'发票','— not mapped —'=>'— 未映射 —','The preset filled in the labels, identifiers and texts. Check them and fill in your identifiers.'=>'预设已填写标签、标识和文本。请检查并填写您的标识。','The fields were added to Envo Blocks > Checkout Fields (contact part of the checkout) and mapped to the invoice.'=>'这些字段已添加到 Envo Blocks > Checkout Fields（结账的联系部分）并映射到发票。','The PDF library is not installed in this copy of the plugin. Invoices are stored and shown as HTML for shop managers only.'=>'此插件副本中未安装 PDF 库。发票会被保存，并仅以 HTML 形式向商店管理员显示。','PDF invoices'=>'PDF 发票','Invoices, credit notes and packing slips for WooCommerce orders. An issued document keeps its data even when the order or these settings change later. The country presets only fill in labels and texts; check them with your accountant – the plugin does not guarantee that they meet local law.'=>'WooCommerce 订单的发票、贷项通知单和装箱单。已开具的文档会保留其数据，即使订单或这些设置之后发生变化。国家/地区预设仅填写标签和文本；请与您的会计核对 – 插件不保证它们符合当地法律。','Issue invoices'=>'开具发票','Country preset'=>'国家/地区预设','Apply preset'=>'应用预设','Fills in the document labels, the identifier names, the tax texts, the paper and the date format. Your name, address, numbers and e-mails stay.'=>'填写文档标签、标识名称、税务文本、纸张和日期格式。您的名称、地址、编号和邮箱保持不变。','Issue at'=>'开具时机','The invoice is issued when the order gets one of these statuses. You can also issue it by hand in the order.'=>'当订单进入以下任一状态时开具发票。您也可以在订单中手动开具。','Also for orders with a zero total'=>'也适用于总额为零的订单','Attach to e-mails'=>'附加到邮件','Credit notes to the "Refunded order" e-mail'=>'将贷项通知单附加到“已退款订单”邮件','Guests'=>'访客','Guests can open their invoice with the link of their order (order key)'=>'访客可以通过其订单链接（订单密钥）打开发票','Seller'=>'卖方','Identifiers'=>'标识','Name, e.g. VAT ID'=>'名称，例如 增值税号','Value'=>'值','Company and tax numbers, as many as your country needs. Empty values are not printed.'=>'公司和税号，按您所在国家/地区的需要填写。空值不会打印。','Registered for VAT / GST / sales tax (prints the tax columns and the tax recap)'=>'已登记增值税 / GST / 销售税（打印税务列和税务汇总）','Bank account'=>'银行账户','Printed on unpaid invoices. Orders paid by bank transfer also get the payment QR code (Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code).'=>'打印在未付款的发票上。通过银行转账支付的订单还会获得付款二维码（Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code）。','E.g. the company register entry, directors, contact.'=>'例如公司注册信息、董事、联系方式。','Choose logo'=>'选择标志','Buyer and products'=>'买方和产品','Buyer identifiers'=>'买方标识','Name on the invoice'=>'发票上的名称','Which checkout field holds the company or tax number of the customer. Printed only when the customer filled it in; with a tax number and no tax, EU orders get the reverse charge text.'=>'哪个结账字段包含顾客的公司编号或税号。仅在顾客填写时打印；有税号但无税的欧盟订单会显示反向征税文本。','Add these fields to the checkout'=>'将这些字段添加到结账','Product fields'=>'产品字段','Own fields of products and variations (e.g. HSN/SAC code, country of origin), edited under the SKU of the product and printed as columns.'=>'产品和变体的自定义字段（例如 HSN/SAC 代码、原产国），在产品的 SKU 下方编辑并作为列打印。','Numbers and dates'=>'编号和日期','Credit notes'=>'贷项通知单','New series every year'=>'每年新系列','New series every month'=>'每月新系列','One series'=>'单一系列','Start at'=>'起始编号','Placeholders: {number}, {number:5} (with zeros), {year}, {year_short}, {fiscal_year}, {month}, {order_number}. A number is never used twice. "Start at" moves the series forward, e.g. when you come from another system.'=>'占位符：{number}、{number:5}（补零）、{year}、{year_short}、{fiscal_year}、{month}、{order_number}。编号永不重复使用。“起始编号”会让系列向前推进，例如从其他系统迁移时。','Year starts in'=>'年度起始月份','For the yearly series, e.g. April for a fiscal year.'=>'用于年度系列，例如财政年度从四月开始。','Date format'=>'日期格式','Date of supply'=>'供货日期','Date of issue'=>'开具日期','Order date'=>'订单日期','Payment date'=>'付款日期','Due in (days)'=>'到期（天）','Unpaid invoices only.'=>'仅未付款的发票。','Payment reference'=>'付款参考号','Order number'=>'订单号','Digits of the invoice number'=>'发票号的数字','Content and look'=>'内容和外观','SKU'=>'SKU','Unit price'=>'单价','Discount'=>'折扣','Tax rate'=>'税率','Tax recap'=>'税务汇总','Taxes as WooCommerce counted them'=>'按 WooCommerce 计算的税费','Tax counted once per rate and document (Japan)'=>'按税率和文档计算一次税费（日本）','Round down'=>'向下取整','Round'=>'四舍五入','Round up'=>'向上取整','With "once per rate" a difference to the order is shown as a rounding line; the total stays the one of the order.'=>'使用“按税率计算一次”时，与订单的差额显示为舍入行；总额保持为订单的总额。','Amounts'=>'金额','Total in words (English)'=>'大写总额（英文）','India'=>'印度','QR payment'=>'二维码付款','QR code on unpaid bank transfer invoices (CZK, EUR)'=>'未付款银行转账发票上的二维码（CZK、EUR）','The code of Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code (its format, account and message). Only an invoice issued before the payment can carry it: to send bank transfer customers the invoice with the code, check "On hold" under "Issue at" and attach the invoice to the "Order on-hold" e-mail.'=>'Envo Blocks > Payment QR Code 的二维码（其格式、账户和附言）。只有在付款前开具的发票才能带有它：要向银行转账顾客发送带二维码的发票，请在“开具时机”下勾选“保留”，并将发票附加到“订单保留”邮件。','Payment QR Code settings'=>'Payment QR Code 设置','Payment terms'=>'付款条款','Printed on every document, e.g. "Thank you for your order".'=>'打印在每份文档上，例如“感谢您的订购”。','Text when not registered for tax'=>'未登记税务时的文本','Reverse charge text'=>'反向征税文本','Reduced rate note'=>'优惠税率说明','When set, items with a lower tax rate get "※" and this note is printed (Japan).'=>'设置后，税率较低的项目会标记“※”并打印此说明（日本）。','Paper and direction'=>'纸张和方向','Text direction of the site language'=>'网站语言的文字方向','Left to right'=>'从左到右','Right to left'=>'从右到左','Labels of the documents'=>'文档的标签','The words printed on the documents, in %s (from the preset). Change any of them, e.g. into your own language.'=>'打印在文档上的文字，使用%s（来自预设）。您可以更改其中任何一项，例如改为您自己的语言。','Show the labels'=>'显示标签','Preview (saved settings)'=>'预览（已保存的设置）','The preview shows the saved settings: save your changes first.'=>'预览显示已保存的设置：请先保存您的更改。','Label, e.g. HSN/SAC'=>'标签，例如 HSN/SAC','Column on the invoice'=>'发票上的列','Fonts'=>'字体','Latin (also Turkish, Vietnamese and all European languages), Greek and Cyrillic are included. Other scripts need a font pack; an invoice with characters of such a script (e.g. a customer name in Japanese) shows a notice in the order. A pack is downloaded from assets.envoblocks.com only once, when you click Download, and every file is checked against its checksum. The fonts are then stored on your site and every PDF uses them from your own server; assets.envoblocks.com is not contacted again.'=>'已包含拉丁文（包括土耳其语、越南语和所有欧洲语言）、希腊文和西里尔文。其他文字需要字体包；含有此类文字字符的发票（例如日文的顾客名称）会在订单中显示提示。字体包仅在您点击“下载”时从 assets.envoblocks.com 下载一次，每个文件都会根据其校验和进行检查。之后字体存储在您的网站上，每个 PDF 都从您自己的服务器使用它们；不会再联系 assets.envoblocks.com。','The font pack is installed. Make the PDF of existing invoices again in the order if they need it.'=>'字体包已安装。如有需要，请在订单中重新生成现有发票的 PDF。','The font pack was removed.'=>'字体包已移除。','Font pack'=>'字体包','Installed'=>'已安装','No connection to assets.envoblocks.com? Upload the zip of a pack:'=>'无法连接 assets.envoblocks.com？请上传字体包的 zip：','Upload'=>'上传','Choose the zip file of the pack.'=>'选择字体包的 zip 文件。','The preview needs at least one order.'=>'预览至少需要一个订单。','HTML preview:'=>'HTML 预览：','Invoice'=>'发票','Invoice %1$s'=>'发票 %1$s','Open PDF'=>'打开 PDF','Send to customer'=>'发送给顾客','The invoice contains characters of a script without a font: install the font pack %s in Envo Blocks > Invoices and make the PDF again.'=>'发票包含没有字体的文字字符：请在 Envo Blocks > 发票 中安装字体包 %s 并重新生成 PDF。','Credit note %s'=>'贷项通知单 %s','Make the PDF again'=>'重新生成 PDF','Cancel and reissue'=>'作废并重新开具','Issue a credit note for the whole invoice and a new invoice with the current order data?'=>'为整张发票开具贷项通知单，并使用当前订单数据开具新发票？','Credit note for the whole invoice'=>'整张发票的贷项通知单','Issue a credit note for the whole invoice?'=>'为整张发票开具贷项通知单？','No invoice yet.'=>'还没有发票。','Issue invoice'=>'开具发票','Packing slip'=>'装箱单','The order does not exist.'=>'订单不存在。','Cancelled and reissued'=>'已作废并重新开具','Invoice cancelled'=>'发票已作废','Invoice sent to %s.'=>'发票已发送至 %s。','Same as the product'=>'与产品相同','Billing company'=>'账单公司','Billing phone'=>'账单电话','Billing state / region'=>'账单省/州 / 地区','Checkout field: %s'=>'结账字段：%s','Japanese'=>'日文','Chinese (Simplified)'=>'中文（简体）','Chinese (Traditional)'=>'中文（繁体）','Korean'=>'韩文','Indian scripts'=>'印度文字','Arabic'=>'阿拉伯文','Hebrew'=>'希伯来文','Thai'=>'泰文','Unknown font pack.'=>'未知的字体包。','The PHP zip extension is missing on this server.'=>'此服务器缺少 PHP zip 扩展。','The file is not a zip archive.'=>'该文件不是 zip 压缩包。','The font pack is not the right one: %s is missing or changed.'=>'字体包不正确：%s 缺失或已更改。','The font files could not be saved in the uploads folder.'=>'无法将字体文件保存到 uploads 文件夹。','The PDF library is missing.'=>'缺少 PDF 库。','International (English)'=>'国际（英文）','European Union (English)'=>'欧盟（英文）','Czech Republic'=>'捷克','Slovakia'=>'斯洛伐克','Germany'=>'德国','Germany: businesses must be able to receive B2B e-invoices (XRechnung / ZUGFeRD) and must send them in the coming years. A PDF is not an e-invoice.'=>'德国：企业必须能够接收 B2B 电子发票（XRechnung / ZUGFeRD），并须在未来几年内开始发送。PDF 不是电子发票。','Austria'=>'奥地利','Poland'=>'波兰','Poland: from 2026 B2B invoices are issued through the national system KSeF. A PDF from this plugin is then only an order document.'=>'波兰：自 2026 年起，B2B 发票通过国家系统 KSeF 开具。届时此插件生成的 PDF 仅为订单文档。','France'=>'法国','France: B2B e-invoicing becomes mandatory from 2026. A PDF is not an e-invoice.'=>'法国：自 2026 年起 B2B 电子发票成为强制要求。PDF 不是电子发票。','United Kingdom'=>'英国','United States'=>'美国','Canada'=>'加拿大','Australia'=>'澳大利亚','Turkey'=>'土耳其','Turkey: businesses registered for e-Fatura or e-Arşiv must issue the legal invoice through the GİB system or an integrator. A PDF from this plugin is then only an order document.'=>'土耳其：已登记 e-Fatura 或 e-Arşiv 的企业必须通过 GİB 系统或集成商开具合法发票。届时此插件生成的 PDF 仅为订单文档。','India (GST)'=>'印度（GST）','India: businesses above the e-invoicing limit must report B2B invoices to the IRP and print the IRN and its QR code. A PDF from this plugin does not do that.'=>'印度：超过电子发票门槛的企业必须向 IRP 报送 B2B 发票，并打印 IRN 及其二维码。此插件生成的 PDF 不具备此功能。','Japan (Qualified Invoice)'=>'日本（合格发票）','United Arab Emirates'=>'阿拉伯联合酋长国','United Arab Emirates: e-invoicing is being introduced. Check whether your business must issue invoices through an accredited provider.'=>'阿拉伯联合酋长国：正在推行电子发票。请确认您的企业是否必须通过认证服务商开具发票。','Saudi Arabia'=>'沙特阿拉伯','Saudi Arabia: VAT-registered businesses must issue e-invoices (FATOORA, ZATCA). A PDF from this plugin is then only an order document.'=>'沙特阿拉伯：已登记增值税的企业必须开具电子发票（FATOORA，ZATCA）。届时此插件生成的 PDF 仅为订单文档。','Brazil'=>'巴西','Brazil: the legal invoice is the NF-e / NFS-e of the tax authority. A PDF from this plugin is only an order document.'=>'巴西：合法发票是税务机关的 NF-e / NFS-e。此插件生成的 PDF 仅为订单文档。','Order on-hold'=>'订单保留','Processing order'=>'处理中订单','Completed order'=>'已完成订单','Order details (sent from the order screen)'=>'订单详情（从订单页面发送）','The invoice is being issued, try again in a moment.'=>'发票正在开具，请稍后重试。','Invoice %s issued.'=>'发票 %s 已开具。','The order has no invoice.'=>'该订单没有发票。','Credit note %s issued.'=>'贷项通知单 %s 已开具。','You cannot open this document.'=>'您无法打开此文档。','The document does not exist (yet).'=>'该文档（尚）不存在。','The PDF could not be made. Please contact the shop.'=>'无法生成 PDF。请联系商店。','This template needs an active Envo Blocks PRO license.'=>'此模板需要有效的 Envo Blocks PRO 许可证。','This theme is not installed.'=>'此主题未安装。','Store page (site header and footer)'=>'商店页面（站点页眉和页脚）','Store page (site header only)'=>'商店页面（仅站点页眉）','Store page (site footer only)'=>'商店页面（仅站点页脚）','Page content without a title, between the header and footer of the site.'=>'不含标题的页面内容，位于站点页眉和页脚之间。','Choose a template first.'=>'请先选择模板。','Choose at least one page to import.'=>'请至少选择一个要导入的页面。','%d page of the template goes to the trash (you can restore it there).'=>'模板的 %d 个页面将移至回收站（您可以在那里恢复）。','You edited the page “%s” after the wizard – it goes to the trash too.'=>'您在向导之后编辑了页面“%s” – 它也会移至回收站。','The theme is switched back to %s.'=>'主题将切换回 %s。','The front page is set back as it was.'=>'首页将恢复为原来的设置。','The site name goes back to “%s”.'=>'站点名称将恢复为“%s”。','You renamed the site to “%s” after the wizard – that name is replaced too.'=>'您在向导之后将站点重命名为“%s” – 该名称也会被替换。','The site logo goes back to the previous one.'=>'站点标志将恢复为之前的标志。','The site logo is removed (the site had none).'=>'站点标志将被移除（站点原来没有标志）。','The header and footer of the theme are put back.'=>'主题的页眉和页脚将被恢复。','You edited the template part “%s” in the Site Editor after the wizard – those edits are lost.'=>'您在向导之后在站点编辑器中编辑了模板组件“%s” – 这些编辑将丢失。','The brand colours of the template are removed.'=>'模板的品牌色将被移除。','Starting draft made by the store wizard – check and complete it for your store and the law of your country before you start selling, then delete this note.'=>'由商店向导创建的初始草稿 – 开始销售前，请根据您的商店和所在国家的法律检查并补充，然后删除此说明。','Seller: %1$s, %2$s, e-mail %3$s.'=>'卖家：%1$s，%2$s，邮箱 %3$s。','[your address]'=>'[您的地址]','What data we collect'=>'我们收集哪些数据','When you order, we collect your name, billing and delivery address, e-mail, phone number and the details of your order. When you create an account, we also keep your login details and order history.'=>'您下单时，我们会收集您的姓名、账单和收货地址、邮箱、电话号码及订单详情。创建账户时，我们还会保存您的登录信息和订单记录。','Why we use it'=>'我们为何使用这些数据','To process and deliver your order, to handle payments, returns and complaints, and to meet our legal and accounting obligations. We send newsletters only if you agree to them.'=>'用于处理和配送您的订单，处理付款、退货和投诉，并履行我们的法律和会计义务。仅在您同意时我们才会发送新闻邮件。','Who we share it with'=>'我们与谁共享数据','With the carrier that delivers your order, the payment provider and our accountant – only what they need. [List your carriers and services here.]'=>'与配送您订单的承运商、支付服务商和我们的会计 – 仅共享他们需要的内容。[请在此列出您的承运商和服务。]','How long we keep it'=>'我们保存多久','Order data as long as accounting law requires; account data until you delete your account.'=>'订单数据按会计法规要求的期限保存；账户数据保存至您删除账户为止。','Your rights'=>'您的权利','You can ask for a copy of your data, its correction or deletion, and object to its use – write to %s. You can also complain to your data protection authority.'=>'您可以要求获取数据副本、更正或删除数据，并反对数据的使用 – 请写信至 %s。您也可以向数据保护机构投诉。','Cookies'=>'Cookie','The store uses cookies needed for the cart and login. [Add analytics or marketing cookies if you use them.]'=>'商店使用购物车和登录所需的 Cookie。[如果使用分析或营销 Cookie，请在此补充。]','Orders'=>'订单','The order is placed when you finish the checkout. You get a confirmation by e-mail; the contract is made when we confirm the order.'=>'完成结账即表示下单。您会收到确认邮件；我们确认订单后合同即成立。','Prices and payment'=>'价格和付款','Prices are shown including tax [check]. You can pay by the methods offered in the checkout; by bank transfer the goods are sent after the payment arrives.'=>'价格已含税 [请检查]。您可以使用结账时提供的方式付款；选择银行转账时，我们会在收到款项后发货。','The delivery methods, prices and times are shown in the checkout. [Add your usual delivery time.]'=>'配送方式、价格和时间会在结账时显示。[请补充您通常的配送时间。]','Returns'=>'退货','You can withdraw from the contract within 14 days of receiving the goods without giving a reason. Send the goods back unused; we refund the payment within 14 days of receiving them.'=>'您可以在收到商品后 14 天内无理由撤销合同。请将未使用的商品寄回；我们会在收到后 14 天内退款。','Complaints'=>'投诉','If the goods are faulty, write to %s with the order number and a description of the fault. We handle complaints within 30 days.'=>'如果商品有缺陷，请写信至 %s，注明订单号并描述缺陷。我们会在 30 天内处理投诉。','WooCommerce is not active.'=>'WooCommerce 未启用。','Free delivery'=>'免运费','Sample product – Classic'=>'示例商品 – 经典款','Sample product – Bestseller'=>'示例商品 – 畅销款','Sample product – Premium'=>'示例商品 – 高级款','Sample product – New'=>'示例商品 – 新品','Sample product – On sale'=>'示例商品 – 促销','Sample product – Gift'=>'示例商品 – 礼品','This is a sample product made by the store wizard. Replace it with your own product, or delete all unedited samples with one click in Envo Blocks › Store in 5 minutes.'=>'这是商店向导创建的示例商品。请替换为您自己的商品，或在 Envo Blocks › 5 分钟开店中一键删除所有未编辑的示例。','Store country'=>'商店所在国家','Price format'=>'价格格式','Bank account (IBAN)'=>'银行账户（IBAN）','WooCommerce settings go back to how they were: %s.'=>'WooCommerce 设置将恢复为原来的状态：%s。','You changed these WooCommerce settings after the wizard – your changes are replaced: %s.'=>'您在向导之后更改了这些 WooCommerce 设置 – 您的更改将被替换：%s。','The pages the wizard made go to the trash: %s.'=>'向导创建的页面将移至回收站：%s。','You edited these pages after the wizard – they go to the trash anyway (you can restore them there): %s.'=>'您在向导之后编辑了这些页面 – 它们仍会移至回收站（您可以在那里恢复）：%s。','Pages the wizard published become drafts again: %s.'=>'向导发布的页面将重新变为草稿：%s。','The delivery zone “%s” is deleted.'=>'配送区域“%s”将被删除。','You changed the delivery zone “%s” after the wizard – it is deleted anyway.'=>'您在向导之后更改了配送区域“%s” – 它仍会被删除。','%d unedited sample product goes to the trash.'=>'%d 个未编辑的示例商品将移至回收站。','%d sample product you edited stays as your product.'=>'您编辑过的 %d 个示例商品将作为您的商品保留。','General – address, selling locations, currency'=>'常规 – 地址、销售地区、货币','Products – shop page, measurements, stock'=>'商品 – 商店页面、尺寸、库存','Tax – prices with or without tax, rates'=>'税费 – 含税或不含税价格、税率','Shipping – zones, methods, classes'=>'配送 – 区域、方式、类别','Payments – payment methods'=>'付款 – 付款方式','Accounts & privacy – guest checkout, data'=>'账户和隐私 – 访客结账、数据','Emails – sender, order e-mails'=>'邮件 – 发件人、订单邮件','Checkout fields'=>'结账字段','Reviews with photos'=>'带照片的评价','Lowest price (EU Omnibus)'=>'最低价格（欧盟 Omnibus）','Product feed (Google, Meta)'=>'商品数据源（Google、Meta）','Abandoned carts'=>'弃置购物车','Back in stock alerts'=>'到货提醒','Sales notifications'=>'销售通知','You cannot switch themes.'=>'您无权切换主题。','Not happy with how your store looks?'=>'对商店的外观不满意？','Your template was made for the Envo Blocks Store theme – with %s the header, fonts and shop pages can look different. Switching keeps your pages and colours, and you can switch back any time.'=>'您的模板是为 Envo Blocks Store 主题制作的 – 使用 %s 时，页眉、字体和商店页面可能看起来不同。切换会保留您的页面和颜色，并且您可以随时切换回来。','Try Envo Blocks Store'=>'试试 Envo Blocks Store','View my store'=>'查看我的商店','I am happy, hide this'=>'我很满意，隐藏此提示']];
